	quest.01FA083161D7DBD7.quest_desc: ["The Alteration Table upgrades armor with threads. To add a thread, place the armor piece on the table, right-click the glyph on the paper part, then take the armor out. To remove threads, place the armor on the table, right-click the paper part and take the armor out."]
