	quest.03A91D89E7C4153D.quest_desc: ["You can use substrate, water, and liquid ethylene in a Pressurized Reaction Chamber to make an HDPE Pellet. These pellets are used to make sheets and rods, which make various blocks, machines, and upgrades."]
