	quest.03DACD9B79FA1E57.quest_desc: ["For only a measly 8EU/t, the Steam Farmer can perform the following things: Tilling: When enabled, dirt blocks will be turned into farmland. This will not work unless water is supplied. Hydrating: When supplied with water, tilled soil will be hydrated. Harvesting: When there is enough output space provided, it will harvest fully grown crops and trees. Plating: When supplied with crops or saplings, it will plant them on valid soil. Using different plating modes will plant them in different arrangements."]
	quest.03DACD9B79FA1E57.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Steam Farmer, 7x Bronze Machine Casing Pipe and 26x Bronze Plated Bricks"
