	quest.04F6758F8F06F5B0.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.04F6758F8F06F5B0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Elite Injecting Factory"
	quest.04F8E790B6B969C1.quest_desc: ["The Calculation Processor is made in an Inscriber from a Printed Calculation Circuit, Printed Silicon and Redstone. It is used for storage cells, crafting storage and more."]
	quest.04FBB7D8C2789148.quest_desc: ["The Advanced Solar Generator is a highly upgraded version of the basic Solar Generator. Construction of an Advanced Solar Generator requires four Solar Generators, but it produces six times the power of its smaller cousin. It also requires an area of 3x3x3 Blocks in order to be placed."]
	quest.04FBB7D8C2789148.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Solar Generator"
	quest.04FCE3DA39375B25.quest_desc: ["Compacts items into their compressed variants. Only 2x2 recipes."]
	quest.04FCE3DA39375B25.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Compacting Upgrade"
	quest.05169AACAFD296C7.quest_desc: ["These Export Buses have more advanced functionality compared to the regular Export Bus. Tag Export Bus exports items from filtered tags. Mod Export Bus exports items from filtered mods. Precise Export Bus exports the exact amount of items you set, no less, no more. Threshold Export Bus exports items when the amount of items is above/below the set threshold."]
	quest.05169AACAFD296C7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Tag Export Bus, Mod Export Bus, Precise Export Bus and Threshold Export Bus"
	quest.05169AACAFD296C7.title: "Advanced Export Buses"
	quest.052BA8035DDE0E09.quest_desc: ["Don’t be fooled… it may appear similar to the humble cauldron, but is flexible enough to work with Belts, Fluid Pipes, and Mechanical Mixers and Presses, enabling the automation of many recipes."]
	quest.052BA8035DDE0E09.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basin"
	quest.05334CEDD6D1FF3A.quest_desc: ["Armor Tomes limit their stored enchantments to the matching armor category, which keeps gear progression focused."]
	quest.05334CEDD6D1FF3A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.05334CEDD6D1FF3A.title: "Tomes of Armor"
	quest.053443DA1DDBC511.quest_desc: ["Uraninite is the reactor fuel."]
	quest.053443DA1DDBC511.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Uraninite"
	quest.054D2D26D71D140A.quest_desc: ["You have reached the final step to invincibility. Armor infused with Quantum Technology to repel all physical and magical attacks. You cannot die, not even by a God's Smite. You can now fly freely without the need of electricity. This set of armor interacts directly with the quantum realm to alter space and time surrounding you. Theoretically, you sitll be stationary, and space will just be moving relative to you. --This-- is the power you wield. This sword can and will slice through anything in it's path. The edge of it's blade has the ability to cleave through time and erase any entity you choose from existence. Use this power responsibly."]
	quest.054D2D26D71D140A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Quantum Sword, Quantum Helmet, Quantum Leggings and 2 more items"
	quest.054D2D26D71D140A.title: "Quantum Armory"
	quest.055085FE22FDA8CB.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Wing of the Wild Stalker. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.055085FE22FDA8CB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wing of the Wild Stalker"
	quest.05675F46ECA3A99A.quest_desc: ["Adds a jukebox to the storage."]
	quest.05675F46ECA3A99A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Jukebox Upgrade"
	quest.0568907D9675E7BA.quest_desc: ["The Productivity upgrade will increase the number of combs a bee produces per trip."]
