	quest.071F381F40CB480E.quest_desc: ["Fusion Reactors are an amazing generator for Mekanism. Virtually running off of water, they can generate a massive amount of power. They, also, can be used to generate a metric ton of heat and steam. However, you will need Polonium from Fission Reactors to create the casings."]
