	quest.09D690F4DD1D4EF9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Polished Rose Quartz"
	quest.09DB1F5FAE8A6BEA.quest_desc: ["The Waste Barrel is the only way to safely store nuclear waste. The top and bottom of the barrel are the only locations you can input and output from. You can NOT move the barrel by ANY means. If you do, the barrel will dump the waste into the area, and much like a meltdown, blanket a large radius in radiation. Waste barrels delete their contents by 1 mb/20 ticks. So, it is a good idea to have several of these. You can, however, use nuclear waste for late Mekanism things."]
	quest.09DB1F5FAE8A6BEA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Radioactive Waste Barrel"
