	quest.0D48055EA367859C.quest_desc: ["Induction Provides make up the transfer rate of the battery, both input and output. Transfer Rate: 52.42 MFE/t."]
	quest.0D48055EA367859C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ultimate Induction Provider"
	quest.0D7977925697B42D.quest_desc: ["Your reactor can produce an incredible amount of steam, but there's no point making all that steam if you can't put it to work. The Industrial Turbine converts steam into FE by spinning its internal rotor and generating power. Build the central turbine components and surround them with the required multiblock structure. Connect the turbine to your reactor's steam output and watch the power roll in. Larger turbines can process more steam and generate more FE, making them an essential part of a serious power-generation setup."]
	quest.0D7977925697B42D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 8x Turbine Blade, 4x Turbine Rotor, 64x Turbine Casing and 5 more items"
	quest.0D7977925697B42D.title: "Turbine Time"
