	quest.0F4F8377906C86C4.title: "Basic Upgrades"
	quest.0F58E19440A090F0.quest_desc: ["Did you have fun with Nuclear Fission? Well, it's time for Nuclear Fusion! Instead of splitting a heavy, unstable nucleus into two lighter nuclei, fusion will combine together two light nuclei which in turn releases vast amounts of energy. This energy can be contained and used to produce Helium Plasma, an extremely energy dense fluid that can be used as the best power source in the world. You can combine gaseous fuels such as Deuterium, Tritium and/or Helium-3 to produce various combinations of Helium Plasma, Tritium, Deuterium, and Hydrogen. Keep in mind, this fusion takes a lot of energy to start going, but can produce much more as a result."]
	quest.0F58E19440A090F0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fusion Reactor, 203x Highly Advanced Machine Hull and 40x Fusion Chamber"
	quest.0F58E19440A090F0.title: "Fusion Reactor"
