	quest.235CFE9AED85B1AB.quest_desc: ["Cleaning up Chalk can be somewhat of a chore by hand. Thankfully, this is a solved problem: use a Brush!"]
	quest.235CFE9AED85B1AB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Brush"
	quest.2369E85866998513.quest_desc: ["The Digital Miner is the scale mining machine of Mekanism. However, this machine is like no other as it \"magically-teleports\" mined blocks to its inventory."]
	quest.2369E85866998513.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Digital Miner"
	quest.236E10245B6308B5.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Slimy Nest. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.236E10245B6308B5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Slimy Nest"
	quest.23734E69D74BA281.quest_desc: ["The Salvaging Table breaks down unwanted Affix Gear into Rarity Materials, which you can use to improve your equipment and progress."]
	quest.23734E69D74BA281.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Salvaging Table and Smart Filter"
	quest.23734E69D74BA281.title: "Salvaging"
	quest.23752F087B6323F4.quest_desc: ["Will make the storage pick up items within its range. Has more filtering options."]
	quest.23752F087B6323F4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Magnet Upgrade"
	quest.239B2A4AFDFA3312.quest_desc: ["Expands the inventory of the shulker box."]
	quest.239B2A4AFDFA3312.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Diamond Shulker Box"
	quest.239D9AC37AC5B8B2.quest_desc: ["Well, this is the time! It will not get you everything, but it will get you a lot of the main ores. Everything comes later. The Steam Quarry is a steam powered multiblock machine that uses different drills that you install onto it to dig deeper than bedrock and retrieves ores straight from the below, whatever might be under there. You can check which ores this method will provide by checking EMI."]
	quest.239D9AC37AC5B8B2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 13x Steel Machine Casing, Steam Quarry, 4x Chain and 6x Steel Machine Casing Pipe"
	quest.239D9AC37AC5B8B2.title: "Infinite Resources?"
	quest.23ADF75576C7CFEF.quest_desc: ["This machine is used to (dis)charge items that operate on Pneumatic Power, such as Drones, Pneumatic Wrenches, and Vortex Cannons. It also manages upgrades for items that can accept them."]
	quest.23ADF75576C7CFEF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Charging Station"
	quest.23BE3D7400003857.quest_desc: ["Plastic blocks a good way of making a cool base. They are aesthetic only."]
	quest.23BE3D7400003857.quest_subtitle: "Obtain White Plastic"
	quest.23C553AD6AC611F8.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Neptunium Helmet, Neptunium Chestplate, Neptunium Leggings and Neptunium Boots. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.23C553AD6AC611F8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Neptunium Helmet, Neptunium Chestplate, Neptunium Leggings and Neptunium Boots"
	quest.23C553AD6AC611F8.title: "Neptunium Armor"
	quest.23C5DE3C94652080.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Printed Circuit Board. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.23C5DE3C94652080.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Printed Circuit Board"
	quest.23CEE8175974CF6B.quest_desc: ["Tier 2 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.23CEE8175974CF6B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Flare"
	quest.23D446FCE94FB7A4.quest_desc: ["The Assembler Matrix can craft hundreds, if not thousands of items per tick, depending on how you configure it."]
