	quest.351240185EE70EA5.quest_desc: ["The Actuator's storage space is limited by default. Stabilizers strengthen its link to the storage dimension so it can store more."]
	quest.351240185EE70EA5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Storage Stabilizer Tier2"
	quest.3542746A9C52E09C.quest_desc: ["Tier 3 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.3542746A9C52E09C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Hex"
	quest.356CA5DB72734326.quest_desc: ["The Second tier of Spellbook only holding 6 Spells."]
	quest.356CA5DB72734326.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Iron Spell Book"
	quest.3570964B2399D29D.quest_desc: ["Source is an important part of Ars Nouveau."]
	quest.3570964B2399D29D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Source Jar"
	quest.357CF9A61FD926BC.quest_desc: ["Smelt Raw Ironwood, which is crafted shapeless from 1 Liveroot, 1 Iron Ingot and 1 Gold Nugget."]
	quest.357CF9A61FD926BC.quest_subtitle: "Get an Ironwood Ingot"
	quest.3581D598234958A5.quest_desc: ["Adds a stonecutter to the storage."]
	quest.3581D598234958A5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Stonecutter Upgrade"
	quest.35A6AB035CFF965E.quest_desc: ["The pedestal is in the Dark Forest ruins. Claim your title there."]
	quest.35A6AB035CFF965E.quest_subtitle: "Place a trophy on the pedestal"
	quest.35A6B43CE99A7691.quest_desc: ["Bring Core 64k into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.35A6B43CE99A7691.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Core 64k"
	quest.35BBD78000100029.quest_desc: ["You will need 59 more Reactor Glass blocks for a total of 123 glass blocks. The frame of the Supercritical Phase Shifter must consist of SPS Casings. The sides, bottom and top can consist of either SPS Casings, Reactor Glass or SPS Ports. In order to insert energy through a port, a Supercharged Coil has to be attached to the SPS Port on the inside of the multiblock. There are other ways of building a SPS, so be sure to look different ways up. Be warned, the more production you want, the resources and power you'll need."]
	quest.35BBD78000100029.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 60x Sps Casing, 3x Sps Port, 59x Reactor Glass and Supercharged Coil"
	quest.35C2A3FE88732660.quest_desc: ["Bring Controls into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.35C2A3FE88732660.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Controls"
	quest.35C6B2C60242EDA2.quest_desc: ["A pre-programmed Drone that collects items within a 17x17x17 area (before range upgrades) centered on the position it's deployed from. This Drone has two basic modes depending on where it is deployed in relation to its deposit inventory: Deploying on top of an inventory will filter what the Drone collects to only match items inside the inventory at the time of deployment. Deploying on the ground next to an inventory will tell the Drone to collect any items within its area."]
	quest.35C6B2C60242EDA2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Collector Drone"
	quest.35D6F66E836AD148.quest_desc: ["The Actuator's storage space is limited by default. Stabilizers strengthen its link to the storage dimension so it can store more."]
	quest.35D6F66E836AD148.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Storage Stabilizer Tier3"
	quest.35DA27939FD74C2A.quest_desc: ["The LV Energy Input Hatch is like a giant electrical inlet. Do remember that you can upgrade the multiblock machine by replacing the Energy Input Hatch with an upgraded tier, increasing the maximum power rate for recipes and increasing overall overclocking capabilities."]
	quest.35DA27939FD74C2A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Lv Energy Input Hatch"
	quest.35DA27939FD74C2A.title: "LV Energy Input Hatch"
