	quest.3F1B5FD368DA75AF.quest_desc: ["Stable Wormholes are placeable access points to the Storage Actuator. Items can be piped in and out, but a transporter spirit is recommended for extraction to avoid lag." "The Storage Remote lets you reach your storage from far away with no range or dimension limit, as long as the actuator's chunk is loaded."]
