	quest.42A1EC7B1A728313.quest_desc: ["This enchantment applies a spell to your Ars Nouveau armor. Enchanter's tools do not need it. For example, Self, Heal and Amplify heals you whenever you get hit."]
	quest.42A1EC7B1A728313.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Enchanted Book"
	quest.42A628C3153EBE1A.quest_desc: ["Increases the speed of ridden mounts."]
