	quest.42B6AC4E503E5F7F.title: "Oreo Ingot"
	quest.42BA7939CF703CB4.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Cloak of the Bloody Feather. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.42BA7939CF703CB4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cloak of the Bloody Feather"
	quest.42CAF522E640BE57.quest_desc: ["A Solar Neutron Activator takes one fluid and uses the power of the sun to turn it into another. It does not use power, but like stated, requires sunlight. This is the one of the first steps into making a fusion reactor. You will need to put Lithium, from the Evap Plants, into it to make Tritium."]
	quest.42CAF522E640BE57.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Solar Neutron Activator"
	quest.42CF588A0AF75C45.quest_desc: ["Tier Installers are used to upgrade various machines into their Factory equivalent. Right-click on the machine with the Tier Installer and it will upgrade that machine. its level (Basic, Advanced, or Elite) depending on the level of the Tier Installer used."]
	quest.42CF588A0AF75C45.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Tier Installer"
	quest.42DFB47A9BF08F29.quest_desc: ["Ensuring you have keybinds set, hold shift over the Helmet piece to see which key you must press to enable Night Vision. Do the same for the Leggings and Boots for Speed Boost and Step Boost respectively. The armor can also be Dyed and Trimmed."]
	quest.42DFB47A9BF08F29.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Nano Helmet, Nano Chestplate, Nano Leggings and Nano Boots"
	quest.42DFB47A9BF08F29.title: "Nano Suit"
