	quest.442C865BA39D437D.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Chef Hat. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.442C865BA39D437D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chef Hat"
	quest.445B1A87EDD03C87.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.445B1A87EDD03C87.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Redstone Signal"
	quest.4460877D3B63EC51.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: Used Steel Upgrade."]
	quest.4460877D3B63EC51.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Used Steel Upgrade"
	quest.4486D8B84EE7D81E.quest_desc: ["Bring Celestigem Sword into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.4486D8B84EE7D81E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Celestigem Sword"
	quest.448B91713475C5C3.quest_desc: ["The Questing Ram only appears in the Quest Grove, which is a rare spawn. Give it one wool of each of the 16 colors, either by right-clicking it or by dropping the wool in front of it."]
	quest.448B91713475C5C3.quest_subtitle: "Give the Questing Ram what it is missing"
	quest.449AC4149447C26B.quest_desc: ["Has a chance to set attackers on fire."]
	quest.449AC4149447C26B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Flame Pendant"
	quest.44ADE9005757637C.quest_desc: ["The Cooking for Blockheads II book lets you craft food using the ingredients in your inventory."]
	quest.44ADE9005757637C.quest_subtitle: "Cook straight from your inventory"
	quest.44CC46E4EFDC509F.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Eclipsealloy Shovel. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.44CC46E4EFDC509F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Eclipsealloy Shovel"
	quest.44CFB3403E8D0BF6.quest_desc: ["The Meteorite Compass points toward the nearest meteorite. Meteorites contain Sky Stone and other useful materials."]
	quest.44CFB3403E8D0BF6.title: "Compass and Meteorite"
	quest.44D4F624126DA371.quest_desc: ["Bring Soul Extractor into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.44D4F624126DA371.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Soul Extractor"
	quest.44DB40AE52CB1D95.quest_desc: ["Enriched Diamond is used in the Metallurgic Infuser. Enriched Diamond yields 80 units of diamond in the Metallurgic Infuser, the same as 8 diamonds."]
	quest.44DB40AE52CB1D95.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Enriched Diamond"
	quest.44F0EF0D7B03A5E2.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Sealed Rapier. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.44F0EF0D7B03A5E2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sealed Rapier"
	quest.45051BB3EEA08C1A.quest_desc: ["NetherEx expands Nether exploration with additional environments and content. Discover its features while traveling through the Nether."]
	quest.45051BB3EEA08C1A.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.4533FE25145D8E82.quest_desc: ["Your second multi-block: The Steam Blast Furnace! This one is nearly the same, with the only difference being it's one taller and uses Fire Clay Bricks instead of regular Bricks. Use the same trick with the Wrench to show you the block placements and don't forget you'll need only 3 hatches this time. They're the same as the Coke Oven, without the fluid output hatch, not yet anyway! You will use this Steam Blast Furnace to make your first Steel!"]
	quest.4533FE25145D8E82.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bronze Item Input Hatch, Bronze Fluid Input Hatch, Bronze Item Output Hatch and 2 more items"
	quest.4533FE25145D8E82.title: "Steam Blast Furnace"
	quest.45410E3C4A9DF1C4.quest_desc: ["Gray Chalk stabilizes pentacles even more than its predecessor."]
	quest.45410E3C4A9DF1C4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chalk Gray Impure"
	quest.454578CEB0618DFA.quest_desc: ["The Beaver increases the speed at which you harvest wood. It will also try to chop down trees."]
	quest.454578CEB0618DFA.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Familiar Beaver"
	quest.4549D908277481DB.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Configurable Honeycomb. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.4549D908277481DB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.454F456F34978425.quest_desc: ["This spirit will mine random Ores. It is also a little faster."]
	quest.454F456F34978425.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Miner Djinni Ores"
	quest.456654B12D46BD13.quest_desc: ["Notable rituals: Awakening creates helpers like amethyst golems, bookwyrms for storage lecterns and weald walkers, which are not very strong. Conjure Island: Plains converts the area around it into another biome. Water and air blocks get replaced, and source is only needed while it runs."]
	quest.456654B12D46BD13.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ritual Burrowing, Ritual Awakening, Ritual Conjure Island Plains and 6 more items"
	quest.456654B12D46BD13.title: "Green Tablets"
	quest.456DB9B6BF60ADA3.quest_desc: ["Tier Installers are used to upgrade various machines into their Factory equivalent. Right-click on the machine with the Tier Installer and it will upgrade that machine. its level (Basic, Advanced, or Elite) depending on the level of the Tier Installer used."]
	quest.456DB9B6BF60ADA3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Tier Installer"
	quest.458A44D96BD7C86A.quest_desc: ["The sword breaks after use, so make the hit count."]
	quest.458A44D96BD7C86A.quest_subtitle: "Attack something with the Glass Sword"
	quest.458B3F19C9BBA511.quest_desc: ["This Module vents high-pressure air when the tube pressure reaches 4.9 bar (19.9 for Advanced Pressure Tubes). While it helps prevent explosions, it results in energy loss and wasted fuel. With a Module Expansion Card, you can precisely adjust the pressure threshold through the GUI."]
	quest.458B3F19C9BBA511.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Safety Tube Module"
	quest.4590F5422A848829.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.4590F5422A848829.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Gust"
	quest.4594A8C1E81F7D37.quest_desc: ["The Eldritch Manuscript is made with Eight Knowledge Fragments and one Echo Shard. These are both found while looting Ancient Cities. Upon use it will give you the power of one Eldritch Scroll that you choose. You may unlock more but, a new Manuscript is needed per scroll."]
	quest.4594A8C1E81F7D37.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Eldritch Manuscript"
	quest.45C0DCC447288A06.quest_desc: ["An Armored Version of the Jetpack."]
	quest.45C0DCC447288A06.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Jetpack Armored"
	quest.45C56FC46B501F99.quest_desc: ["The Second Highest Tiered Storage Cell in normal AE2, which can contain 65,536 bytes of storage. 65,536 bytes of storage can hold 8,128 Stacks of a single item. or 4,160 Stacks,while holding 63 Different items."]
	quest.45C56FC46B501F99.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Item Storage Cell 64k"
	quest.45D60F041613F241.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Buddhas Hand Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.45D60F041613F241.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Buddhas Hand Sapling"
	quest.45E5BA0514FCA493.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Midnight Mantle. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.45E5BA0514FCA493.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Midnight Mantle"
	quest.45E8EC554D3F1E25.quest_desc: ["The Laser Matrix System is the only way for the Fusion Reactor to start. It requires millions of RF to run, so make sure you have ample power to run these lasers. The Laser Amplifier takes in lasers and stores the energy. You can use a redstone signal to tell it to output the energy. This one should be directed at the reactor's laser focus matrix. The Tractor Beam takes in lasers and outputs them in a different direction. This is a way to add more lasers to your system to store more power faster. They can, also, be used to mine blocks. The laser is, well, the laser. The laser will mine blocks, so make sure to know where it's pointing."]
	quest.45E8EC554D3F1E25.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Laser Amplifier, Laser Tractor Beam and Laser"
	quest.45EE0F13462F75B7.quest_desc: ["Let your favorite mob drive your trains!"]
	quest.45EE0F13462F75B7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Schedule"
	quest.45F7B6D8B7FB411A.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Tertium Sword, Tertium Pickaxe, Tertium Shovel and 2 more items. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.45F7B6D8B7FB411A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Tertium Sword, Tertium Pickaxe, Tertium Shovel and 2 more items"
	quest.45F7B6D8B7FB411A.title: "Tertium Tools and Weaponry"
	quest.46053853A84567F9.quest_desc: ["The arcane core is to be placed beneath the enchanting apparatus to aid in magical endeavors."]
	quest.46053853A84567F9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Arcane Core"
	quest.460573A814CB8315.quest_desc: ["BetterEnd transforms the End with new biomes, terrain, plants, and resources. Explore beyond the familiar islands to discover its altered landscapes."]
	quest.460573A814CB8315.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.461FC236C6A942D3.quest_desc: ["This allows to and from transfer of source from many jars at once."]
	quest.461FC236C6A942D3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Relay Splitter"
	quest.462AB51D40A6902B.quest_desc: ["Flux Dust comes from redstone. Place obsidian above bedrock, drop redstone dust between them, then left-click the obsidian. You can use as much redstone as you like each time."]
	quest.462AB51D40A6902B.quest_subtitle: "Make Flux Dust from redstone"
	quest.463E9EA378DD2604.quest_desc: ["This Machine can place Fluids in the world, It's highly configurable."]
	quest.463E9EA378DD2604.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fluidplacert1"
	quest.46517FD86E76A766.quest_desc: ["Robit is Mekanism's mechanical companion. He can act as a crafting grid, a furnace, an anvil, a chest, or simply a cute little buddy."]
	quest.46517FD86E76A766.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Robit"
	quest.46535886413DEE2A.quest_desc: ["The lowest tier of the stack upgrades."]
	quest.46535886413DEE2A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Stack Upgrade Starter Tier"
	quest.46753DE03E5ECFB9.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Hawthorn Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.46753DE03E5ECFB9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Hawthorn Sapling"
	quest.4681D2BA66A2EBE4.quest_desc: ["Induction Provides make up the transfer rate of the battery, both input and output. Transfer Rate: 6.55 MFE/t."]
	quest.4681D2BA66A2EBE4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Elite Induction Provider"
	quest.468CD002E147A5DD.quest_desc: ["Bring Rider Flute into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.468CD002E147A5DD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rider Flute"
	quest.468FA0F4EEF3ED46.quest_desc: ["The Extended Buses have increased upgrade slots, and are 8x faster."]
	quest.468FA0F4EEF3ED46.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ex Export Bus Part and Ex Import Bus Part"
	quest.468FA0F4EEF3ED46.title: "Extended Buses"
	quest.46931846DB13F776.quest_desc: ["Threads are upgrades for your Ars armor. Each armor piece has up to 3 slots, and a higher slot level gives a stronger effect. Some threads only work in a level 3 slot, and threads do not stack, only the highest level is active." "Notable threads: High Step adds step height per level, Wixie extends potion duration, and Undying acts as a Totem of Undying when you sleep." "Wixie's Enchanting Apparatus with AE2 makes this easier."]
	quest.46931846DB13F776.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thread Depths, Thread Heights, Thread Whirlisprig and 16 more items"
	quest.46931846DB13F776.title: "All The Threads"
	quest.46A2949DFA16CC6E.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Configurable Honeycomb. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.46A2949DFA16CC6E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.46BA34923525F3D8.quest_desc: ["Changes player-related spawning conditions, so the spawner cares less about players being nearby."]
	quest.46BA34923525F3D8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ignore Players Spawner Rune"
	quest.46BA34923525F3D8.title: "Ignore Players Spawner Rune"
	quest.46C76FD0C9D0F414.quest_desc: ["Makes the backpack pick up items that you walk over."]
	quest.46C76FD0C9D0F414.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pickup Upgrade"
	quest.46CA95E874EC90D1.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.46CA95E874EC90D1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Compressing Factory"
	quest.46F11C259FC72F5D.quest_desc: ["An Export Bus pushes selected items from your network into an attached inventory. Use it to supply machines or keep blocks stocked."]
	quest.46FD132CE008A57A.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Smart Filter. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.46FD132CE008A57A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.470B9BBE473E4872.quest_desc: ["The \"Quartz in Netherrack\" block is an alternative recipe for the Quartz Nest. It is crafted with 1 Netherrack and 8 Nether Quartz."]
	quest.470B9BBE473E4872.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Nether Quartz Nest"
	quest.470C6BCB3EB14006.quest_desc: ["Will calcify and lose efficiency over time to a minimum of 33% efficiency when not using Distilled Water. Using an Axe on the Boiler will reset its calcification."]
	quest.470C6BCB3EB14006.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bronze Solar Boiler"
	quest.470D9FDD6617D4F6.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Shield of Retaliation. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.470D9FDD6617D4F6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Shield of Retaliation"
	quest.4725035EE888EDE4.quest_desc: ["The Redstone Control Module is meant to let you control your machines with redstone! Right Clicking the module in your hand will change its setting from the machine requiring a High Signal to Low Signal and vice versa. Then place it into the redstone module slot. What this means is: While the setting is on High Signal, the machine will only function if it is given a redstone signal. No redstone signal will turn it off. While the setting is on Low Signal, the machine will only function if it is not given a redstone signal. A redstone signal will turn it off."]
	quest.4725035EE888EDE4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Redstone Control Module"
	quest.472D846A7E655FAC.quest_desc: ["Gives you a longer window to reel in a fish."]
	quest.472D846A7E655FAC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Redstone Hook"
	quest.47515072B948EB9E.quest_desc: ["Shadowpulse Goo turns Netherite Blocks into Eclipse Alloy. It is fed with Sculk or Sculk Catalysts, and it can produce lower-tier resources faster. Celestigem and Eclipse Alloy tools, weapons and armor need power to work."]
	quest.47515072B948EB9E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 2x Raw Eclipsealloy, 2x Eclipsealloy Ingot and Gooblock Tier4"
	quest.47515072B948EB9E.title: "Making Eclipse Alloy"
