	quest.4980BCED9BDBA721.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Flask of the Red Mist. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.4980BCED9BDBA721.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Flask of the Red Mist"
	quest.4998F33B8C4E6757.quest_desc: ["This machine uses energy to extract dusts out of certain blocks and ores, making it essential to producing different kinds of tools. Not to be mistaken with the Crusher, this machine is the pulverizer equivalent in other mods."]
	quest.4998F33B8C4E6757.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Enrichment Chamber"
	quest.499BFE8BA61C89CC.quest_desc: ["A pre-programmed Drone that defends a 31x31x31 area centered on the position it's deployed from. This Drone has two basic modes depending on how it is deployed: Deploying on the ground will tell the Drone to attack any mobs which enter its area using whatever it already has on-board. Deploying on top of an inventory containing a Weapon or Minigun Ammo (assuming the drone is carrying a minigun upgrade) will tell the Drone to arm itself using items inside the inventory before defending its area."]
	quest.499BFE8BA61C89CC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Guard Drone"
	quest.49AD5BF5AA91F934.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for End Stone Nest. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.49AD5BF5AA91F934.quest_subtitle: "Obtain End Stone Nest"
	quest.49CD7119588EFBCE.quest_desc: ["This is used to generate source from nearby food."]
	quest.49CD7119588EFBCE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mycelial Sourcelink"
	quest.49D28B33799B36AB.quest_desc: ["Craft a Bank Link together with the Bank you want to link it to. The Bank is not consumed." "Put the linked Bank in a Bank Dock to reach the same contents from multiple places and stash items on the go."]
	quest.49D28B33799B36AB.quest_subtitle: "Access one Bank from several places"
	quest.49E6B0016D1E1DD1.quest_desc: ["The most basic miner spirit. It will bring back random blocks, some of which may be ore."]
	quest.49E6B0016D1E1DD1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Miner Foliot Unspecialized"
	quest.4A1035A5566EB4A1.quest_desc: ["This spirit takes care of farming trees for you. It even attempts to replant them!"]
	quest.4A1035A5566EB4A1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Book of Binding Bound Foliot, Smart Filter and 4x Oak Sapling. Earn the advancement: Summon Foliot Lumberjack"
	quest.4A1035A5566EB4A1.title: "Ritual: Summon Foliot Lumberjack"
	quest.4A161F6CA84621D3.quest_desc: ["The Calculation Press is used in an Inscriber to turn Certus Quartz into a Printed Calculation Circuit. Presses are found in meteorites, and the Inscriber can duplicate one with an Iron Block."]
	quest.4A18F79E859C2F35.quest_desc: ["Bring Piglin Mask into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.4A18F79E859C2F35.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Piglin Mask"
