	quest.4C7E231442DC94DF.quest_desc: ["The Color Applicator can be used to paint colorable blocks, which include cables, wool, terracotta, glass, concrete and anything else you can think of. Use Paintballs or Specific Dyes to paint and snowballs to clean off the paint. Use the Charger to charge the Applicator. The Color Applicator works like a Storage Cell, so to fill it, use the ME Chest. Right-Click to apply a color and Scroll-Wheel to change colors while holding shift. Test different upgrades to see if they can help your Color Applicator!"]
