	quest.4C873325175C838A.quest_desc: ["The Fusion Reactor is a complicated structure. In simple terms it requires at least 1, or 2, inputs for fuel, and 1 out for power. You may, also, add an output for heat that you can use elsewhere. It requires a laser matrix for the lasers to start the reaction. Aside from the casings, it, also, requires the controller on the top."]
