	quest.50F5BF288092DA4C.title: "Making Blazegold"
	quest.50F91BB8CC3D567C.quest_desc: ["The Supercritical Phase Shapeshifter, or SPS, is a machine that allows you to make Anti-Matter with Polonium Gas. It is a very expensive machine as each casing requires about 50,000 mb of processed nuclear waste. The next step will give you a list of the cheapest machine that can be built."]
	quest.50F91BB8CC3D567C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sps Casing and 64x Reactor Glass"
	quest.510764F4358838A6.quest_desc: ["This pickaxe may be more useful for making miner spirits than it is for you, but it is far better than its brittle predecessor."]
	quest.510764F4358838A6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Iesnium Pickaxe"
	quest.515E9B6FC30553FF.quest_desc: ["Bring Configurable Honeycomb into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
