	quest.51DE330522B63BCD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Experience Seeds"
	quest.51E1D9A455E35136.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Blazegold Hoe. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.51E1D9A455E35136.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blazegold Hoe"
	quest.51E7C2E50E79D554.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for 36x Reactor Hardened. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.51E7C2E50E79D554.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 36x Reactor Hardened"
	quest.51EEABBE1E2F6328.quest_desc: ["Mobs spawned by the spawner stay young. Useful for a reliable source of baby mobs."]
	quest.51EEABBE1E2F6328.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Youthful Spawner Rune"
	quest.51EEABBE1E2F6328.title: "Youthful Spawner Rune"
	quest.51F2C82D9D23C8B6.quest_desc: ["The extended devices are too complex for a crafting table to craft, so you will need a Crystal Assembler to craft most of them. Note: The screen face can't connect to network. It can also perform certain in-world transformation recipes, like fluix transformation."]
	quest.51F2C82D9D23C8B6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Crystal Assembler"
	quest.520117A4C0AB83B0.quest_desc: ["Logistical Transporters are Mekanism's way of transporting items. They are smarter compared to other item pipes and can be highly configured with the Configurator. Transfer Rate: 128 items/10 m/s."]
	quest.520117A4C0AB83B0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ultimate Logistical Transporter"
	quest.520DC59E286485A5.quest_desc: ["The Cthulhu allows you to breathe underwater."]
	quest.520DC59E286485A5.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Familiar Cthulhu"
	quest.5211110B50732D75.quest_desc: ["The Lich sits in a large tower compound with several branching towers in the forest. A spell prevents breaking blocks and harming enemies there, and the only way in is to beat the Naga first." "Taking one of its scepters opens the Swamp, the Snow Forest and the Dark Forest."]
	quest.5211110B50732D75.quest_subtitle: "Defeat the Lich"
	quest.5211110B50732D75.title: "Lich"
	quest.52242A836ECF9338.quest_desc: ["Variants to find: Crimson, End, Nether Brick and Warped."]
	quest.52242A836ECF9338.quest_subtitle: "Find all 4 Shipwreck variants"
	quest.52263E1ACB092CB6.quest_desc: ["The ME Active Formation Plane works like the regular Formation Plane, except it pulls the blocks/items from the system without you having to push to it, pretty handy, isn't it?"]
	quest.52263E1ACB092CB6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Active Formation Plane"
	quest.5228BC5CD6332CB9.quest_desc: ["Increases damage dealt by the wearer."]
	quest.5228BC5CD6332CB9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Power Glove"
	quest.522E47967E2D1302.quest_desc: ["Tier 2 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.522E47967E2D1302.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Crush"
	quest.523A813DCCD4F794.quest_desc: ["Bring Imperium Farmland into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.523A813DCCD4F794.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Imperium Farmland"
	quest.523D227B254066FF.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Experience Disperser. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.523D227B254066FF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Experience Disperser"
	quest.525383DAACB08E92.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.525383DAACB08E92.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Combining Factory"
	quest.5257768CB9588EB9.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Atlantic Cod. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.5257768CB9588EB9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Atlantic Cod"
	quest.527EB36537EAF0E1.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Ferricore Shovel. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.527EB36537EAF0E1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ferricore Shovel"
	quest.528055FF0AF18D4E.quest_desc: ["The Refinery is a multiblock in which you place the Refinery Controller on the bottom and Refineries on top of it, two to begin with. You can place up to 4 but this will not increase the speed of the Refinery, but allow it to produce other fluids from Crude Oil. With just the two Refineries on top of it you will start outputting Diesel and LPG , as you gather the resources, adding another Refinery will get you Kerosene and another, you will get Gasoline. To use the Refinery you will need heat, heat can be sourced from Torches around the machine for low efficiency, lava for mid efficiency, and produced heat from a Vortex Tube using pressure."]
	quest.528055FF0AF18D4E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Refinery, 4x Refinery Output and Liquid Hopper"
	quest.528055FF0AF18D4E.title: "Refinery"
	quest.528FA94494267B63.quest_desc: ["An Energy Cube is an advanced type of battery that is compatible with multiple energy systems. An upgraded version of the Basic Energy Cube."]
	quest.528FA94494267B63.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Energy Cube"
	quest.529CF4A2148025ED.quest_desc: ["Not every item needs to go wherever the network sends it. Restrictive and Diversion Transporters give you more control over how items move through your Logistical Transporter network. Restrictive Transporter. Acts as an overflow route. Items will only enter it when they have nowhere else to go, making it useful for handling excess items or directing unwanted materials to a backup destination. Diversion Transporter. Acts as a priority route. It encourages items to pass through it before normal transporter paths, making it useful for directing specific items toward a preferred destination. Use both together to build organized item networks that know where your resources should - and shouldn't - go."]
	quest.529CF4A2148025ED.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Restrictive Transporter and Diversion Transporter"
	quest.529CF4A2148025ED.title: "Transporters"
	quest.52B649A4C67B36B5.quest_desc: ["Achieved by enriching Obsidian in the Enrichment Chamber."]
	quest.52B649A4C67B36B5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dust Obsidian"
	quest.52D99D07D61411D7.quest_desc: ["The ME Extended Drive an ME Drive with a larger cell inventory. It can hold 20 storage cells."]
	quest.52D99D07D61411D7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ex Drive"
	quest.52E14D8C193546FC.quest_desc: ["Expands the inventory of the barrel."]
	quest.52E14D8C193546FC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Diamond Barrel"
	quest.52E14D8C193546FC.title: "Diamond Barrel"
	quest.52E2B96B9F768E56.quest_desc: ["Waystones provide a way to travel between discovered destinations. Find and activate them as you explore to make future journeys easier."]
	quest.52E2B96B9F768E56.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.52E582A995B952D6.quest_desc: ["Found in the Bronze Dungeon. Time to challenge the Silver Dungeon."]
	quest.52E582A995B952D6.quest_subtitle: "Get the Valkyrie Lance"
