	quest.5BA6B722B2CD05D4.quest_desc: ["Augment the ritual with an item to get a Wayfinder, which works like a compass. It points to the nearest structure from the ritual location and shows how far away it is." "Notable structures: Nether Fortress, Bastion, Ocean Monument, Ancient City, End City, Wilden Den and Arcane Library."]
