	quest.5F3CF8C042B1EA0F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blackthorn Sapling"
	quest.5F3D5CFDCAB77C5C.quest_desc: ["Demand-side drivers at the heart of the modern smart Create factory."]
	quest.5F3D5CFDCAB77C5C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Factory Gauge"
	quest.5F3EE79C401EB144.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Key Lime Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.5F3EE79C401EB144.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Key Lime Sapling"
	quest.5F4CE2C211D3C196.quest_desc: ["Extended Pattern Provider holds quadruple the patterns compared to a regular. Extended Molecular Assembler does 8 crafting jobs at once at 2x the speed of a regular, totaling to a 16x increase in crafting speed."]
	quest.5F4CE2C211D3C196.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ex Pattern Provider and Ex Molecular Assembler"
	quest.5F5503976BB2D2E1.quest_desc: ["This Emitter uses Mercury Flux to generate heat that can be used in place of the Pyromantic Brazier."]
	quest.5F5503976BB2D2E1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Caloric Flux Emitter"
	quest.5F6D2504DB8572FD.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Slimy Delight Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.5F6D2504DB8572FD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Slimy Delight Sapling"
	quest.5F8A91444A82D83D.quest_desc: ["The Sink provides water for recipes, and it also works as an endless water source."]
	quest.5F8A91444A82D83D.quest_subtitle: "Water for recipes"
	quest.5FA03F32B08B10A8.quest_desc: ["An Isotopic Centrifuge is yet another machine that turns one fluid into another. This time, by pumping in Uranium HexaFluoride, you get Fissile Fuel."]
	quest.5FA03F32B08B10A8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Isotopic Centrifuge"
	quest.5FA0C345999713B1.quest_desc: ["Adds a furnace to the storage."]
	quest.5FA0C345999713B1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smelting Upgrade"
	quest.5FAD05D83FC3CA5A.quest_desc: ["Ender Pearls are not consumed but cost hunger instead, and they deal no damage."]
	quest.5FAD05D83FC3CA5A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Warp Drive"
	quest.5FB1EAE6C4CFACE6.quest_desc: ["The QIO Dashboard is your main interface with the QIO System. You just need to set the frequency and you're good to go."]
	quest.5FB1EAE6C4CFACE6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Qio Dashboard"
	quest.5FB42611559F0E41.quest_desc: ["With a Quantum Bridge Card you can access your ME System from anywhere in the world. You'll need to setup a Quantum Ring with an Entangled Singularity and another in your Wireless Terminal after placing the Quantum Bridge Card in the terminal. Make sure the Quantum Ring is chunk loaded or else it will not work."]
	quest.5FB42611559F0E41.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Quantum Bridge Card"
	quest.5FD811D4BCBB4E6E.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Configurable Honeycomb. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.5FD811D4BCBB4E6E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.5FD928205FF68580.quest_desc: ["This Rod is pre-attuned to find a Common material."]
