	quest.609DB7F8B0684C8A.quest_desc: ["The Ink comes in different rarities and you will need higher tier Ink for the higher tier scrolls."]
	quest.609DB7F8B0684C8A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.609DB7F8B0684C8A.title: "Ink"
	quest.60ADB70BA2114BD3.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Rainbow Trout. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.60ADB70BA2114BD3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rainbow Trout"
	quest.60B8E8055DEBAC2A.quest_desc: ["Can be (dis)charged using a Charging Station. It's essential for crafting most pneumatically chargeable items and can also be used to charge other items. The amount of power generated depends heavily on the speed of the wind (obviously), and the speed of the wind increases the higher in the world the Wind Generator is placed."]
