	quest.61AEF81C114513BB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Quantum Sword"
	quest.61AEF81C114513BB.title: "Annihilation Operator"
	quest.61BC4DC8D08E44FE.quest_desc: ["The Overdrive Module will prevent the efficiency of an electric machine from going down, but force the machine to use full power all the time, even if it isn't processing anything. The effiency will reset if the recipe the machine is processing changes."]
	quest.61BC4DC8D08E44FE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Overdrive Module"
	quest.61BDFE874D356920.quest_desc: ["The Simple Reforging Table replaces an item's Affixes with a new random combination. It is a cheaper alternative to the full Reforging Table."]
	quest.61BDFE874D356920.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Simple Reforging Table"
	quest.61BDFE874D356920.title: "Simple Reforging"
	quest.61E515AF1B72B1FA.quest_desc: ["It's hover and SHIFT info says it all: \"Unidirectional powered rail with variable speed controlled by the signal strength supplied to it.\"."]
	quest.61E515AF1B72B1FA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Controller Rail"
	quest.61E727F68F8EA832.quest_desc: ["The Concurrent Press is used inside the Inscriber to craft the Concurrent Processor."]
	quest.61E727F68F8EA832.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Concurrent Processor Press"
	quest.61EA178AF98220E7.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Mv Diesel Generator. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
