	quest.61EA178AF98220E7.title: "Fast and Furious"
	quest.61EFF94B2CBDACCF.quest_desc: ["To rotate blocks, right-click them. To toggle the corresponding side of a Pressure Tube between open and closed, right-click the tube."]
	quest.61EFF94B2CBDACCF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pneumatic Wrench"
	quest.61F3771F024D83E7.quest_desc: ["Like the Feeding Upgrade, with more control over when you get fed."]
	quest.61F3771F024D83E7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Feeding Upgrade"
	quest.623F27E9DA2E2993.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Prudentium Gemstone. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.623F27E9DA2E2993.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Prudentium Gemstone"
	quest.624035E8E15B72C2.quest_desc: ["Tier 2 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.624035E8E15B72C2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Cold Snap"
	quest.625FBA4D1405E41A.quest_desc: ["Quark adds many smaller features across building, exploration, items, and quality of life. Check its in-game descriptions and config-enabled features to discover what is active in this pack."]
	quest.625FBA4D1405E41A.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.625FF6B855DA850D.quest_desc: ["Machine Hulls contain the main electronics to allow machines to run. There are different tiers to machine hulls, each allowing you to upgrade your machines. The Basic Machine Hull is the base of every machine that takes LV power. If you want your machine to accept MV power, you must upgrade it using an Advanced Machine Hull. You can do this by right clicking the machine with the upgraded hull in your hand or by placing it in the top right slot of the machine's GUI that seems to have a small isometric cube depiction. You can do the same with higher tier hulls as they will allow for higher tier power sources."]
	quest.625FF6B855DA850D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Machine Hull"
	quest.625FF6B855DA850D.title: "Machine Hulls"
	quest.6265515BFE6B5CC2.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Cell Component 4m. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.6265515BFE6B5CC2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cell Component 4m"
	quest.6274CAF76FF7FAFB.quest_desc: ["Find a Jungle Fortress, the Repurposed Structures version of a Nether Fortress."]
	quest.6274CAF76FF7FAFB.quest_subtitle: "Enter a Jungle Fortress"
	quest.62A978B0A256B155.quest_desc: ["Poisonous Potatoes are used to craft Nature Scrolls."]
	quest.62A978B0A256B155.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Poisonous Potato"
	quest.62CDE865C4D7CB2F.quest_desc: ["Applies a potion effect to the surrounding mobs, players included."]
	quest.62CDE865C4D7CB2F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Potion Diffuser"
	quest.62E86F002AD0EDD5.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Diesel Chainsaw. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.62E86F002AD0EDD5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Diesel Chainsaw"
	quest.62E86F002AD0EDD5.title: "The Texas Chain Saw Massacre"
	quest.63018989221AC000.quest_desc: ["Simply a must have for the fast factory."]
	quest.63018989221AC000.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rotation Speed Controller"
	quest.63048F22F1981561.quest_desc: ["Bring Crafting Unit into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.63048F22F1981561.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Crafting Unit"
	quest.63068E939646FE7A.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Prairie Crabapple Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.63068E939646FE7A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Prairie Crabapple Sapling"
	quest.630C7784CE9C7EAA.quest_desc: ["Use a Freezer together with Icestone on an accessory."]
	quest.630C7784CE9C7EAA.quest_subtitle: "Freeze an accessory"
	quest.632B8206B3F33C7C.quest_desc: ["Variants to find: Birch, Dark Forest, Giant Tree Taiga, Mangrove, Oak and Taiga."]
	quest.632B8206B3F33C7C.quest_subtitle: "Find all 6 Witch Hut variants"
	quest.632BD42D55D3EA8E.quest_desc: ["Bring Frostward Ring and Ice Staff into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.632BD42D55D3EA8E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Frostward Ring and Ice Staff"
	quest.6332C7EE9A88D842.quest_desc: ["This Machine can place Blocks in the world, It's highly configurable."]
	quest.6332C7EE9A88D842.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blockplacert1"
	quest.6337A88D3784E1FA.quest_desc: ["Used to bring an illager raid when used within a village."]
	quest.6337A88D3784E1FA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ritual Challenge"
	quest.6351CC7A32F8CD13.quest_desc: ["The quests in this chapter only show a suggested progression. You can complete them in any order."]
	quest.6351CC7A32F8CD13.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Enter Aether"
	quest.635D2EAFF7FA5E7E.quest_desc: ["To craft Redstone Crystal throw 1 Block of Redstone, 1 Glowstone Dust, and 1 Fluix Crystal into water and watch the magic happen."]
	quest.635D2EAFF7FA5E7E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Redstone Crystal"
	quest.6381EB59F371696B.quest_desc: ["Several types of Salt exist, each used to create different resources in the end. Some Salts can be calcinated again into other kinds."]
	quest.6381EB59F371696B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Alchemical Salt Strata, Alchemical Salt Mineral, Alchemical Salt Plant and Alchemical Salt Creature"
	quest.6381EB59F371696B.title: "Alchemical Salts"
	quest.6386B9D6B0829708.quest_desc: ["A pre-programmed Drone that performs logistics tasks within a 31x31x31 area centered on the position it is deployed from."]
	quest.6386B9D6B0829708.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Logistics Drone"
	quest.639BE4FC6AF750B4.quest_desc: ["Bring Capacitor into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.639BE4FC6AF750B4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Capacitor"
	quest.639BE4FC6AF750B4.title: "The C in RLC"
	quest.63BBBD09FE89D89D.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Pink Ipe Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.63BBBD09FE89D89D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pink Ipe Sapling"
	quest.63CB2C4A3B28C05D.quest_desc: ["The Matter Cannon uses Matter Balls and different Metal Nuggets to deal damage by shooting them at opponents. It can be charged in the Charger and refilled in an ME Chest, just as you would a Storage Drive. Test out upgrades to see if any can make your Matter Cannon better!"]
	quest.63CB2C4A3B28C05D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Matter Cannon"
	quest.63CB2C4A3B28C05D.title: "Matter Cannon"
	quest.63E4BEB3B88F6540.quest_desc: ["Thermodynamic Conductors are a way of transporting heat. Insulation: 400."]
	quest.63E4BEB3B88F6540.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Thermodynamic Conductor"
	quest.640052AE59DB4B84.quest_desc: ["This is the last CPU you'll ever need, it handles all the crafting jobs you throw at it. The more Quantum Computer Storage blocks you have in the structure, the more crafting jobs it can handle at once."]
	quest.640052AE59DB4B84.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Quantum Core, Data Entangler, Quantum Multi Threader and 3 more items"
	quest.640A6C22B23AF91D.quest_desc: ["Extends the invincibility time after taking damage."]
	quest.640A6C22B23AF91D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cross Necklace"
	quest.6419797CDC6482E2.quest_desc: ["Bring Configurable Honeycomb into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6419797CDC6482E2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.642644B33DEC6D7E.quest_desc: ["Bring Coal Seeds into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.642644B33DEC6D7E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Coal Seeds"
	quest.642CC869E844C762.quest_desc: ["Generates source by consuming burnables."]
	quest.642CC869E844C762.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Volcanic Sourcelink"
	quest.6430F9D2F201DA49.quest_desc: ["Tier 2 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.6430F9D2F201DA49.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Slowfall"
	quest.6445C75E5366698D.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Lapis Lazuli Seeds. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6445C75E5366698D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Lapis Lazuli Seeds"
	quest.6461D4F6C50DEA4C.quest_desc: ["Swaps blocks and entities between paired Swappers, so you can transport blocks between worlds."]
	quest.6461D4F6C50DEA4C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blockswappert1"
	quest.6472989111B260A5.quest_desc: ["Motors take electricity and produce a rotational force. You'll use motors to create many of the machines and other components in the future. You should automate these."]
	quest.6472989111B260A5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Motor"
	quest.6472989111B260A5.title: "Motors"
	quest.64730C62AE083D95.quest_desc: ["Speeds up the growth of baby bees. Put the BaBee in a cage and insert it with some honey treats."]
	quest.64730C62AE083D95.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Incubator"
	quest.64876E4A94758E1C.quest_desc: ["Bring power, a controller, a terminal, a drive with a storage cell, and cable together to form a working ME network. Use the network as a foundation for the branches that follow."]
	quest.64876E4A94758E1C.title: "Build Your First ME Network"
	quest.64A6A68085FAFF36.quest_desc: ["Flexible, non-conductive, and strong. Rubber will be a major part of every electric machine. You can produce it by mixing Paper with either Synthetic Oil or Synthetic Rubber. Mix the Coke Dust you made with Water in a Mixer to produce Raw Synthetic Oil. Use a Steam Blast Furnace to produce these two fluids. Synthetic Rubber is more difficult to obtain, but will yield more rubber per sheet of paper. Remember that you'll need a lot of Rubber Sheets in the long run, so you'll need to make them constantly. Note that you can use Wood to grind down and turn into Wood Pulp which can then be turned into Paper with a high output yield."]
	quest.64A6A68085FAFF36.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rubber Sheet"
	quest.64A6A68085FAFF36.title: "Rubber"
	quest.64A6E404227AA12A.quest_desc: ["QIO Drives hold the items in a QIO System. They work similar to AE2 drives where it has a maximum amount of space and types it can hold."]
	quest.64A6E404227AA12A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Qio Drive Base"
	quest.64A8A849A96982CF.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Knightmetal Helmet, Knightmetal Chestplate, Knightmetal Leggings and Knightmetal Boots. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.64A8A849A96982CF.quest_subtitle: "Craft a full set of Knightmetal Armor"
	quest.64A8A849A96982CF.title: "Knightmetal Armorer"
	quest.64AEB967047B14B1.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Wenge Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.64AEB967047B14B1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wenge Sapling"
	quest.64B15654C8144611.quest_desc: ["Enriched Tin is used in the Metallurgic Infuser. Enriched Tin yields 80 units of tin in the Metallurgic Infuser, the same as 8 Tin Dust."]
	quest.64B15654C8144611.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Enriched Tin"
	quest.64C0EB318F14295F.quest_desc: ["The Advanced Fluid Tank can hold up to 28000mB of fluids which is double the amount of the Basic Fluid Tank. It can double as a bucket by switching its mode to bucket mode."]
	quest.64C0EB318F14295F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Fluid Tank"
	quest.64F465D465EBF4FB.quest_desc: ["Bring Sheep Seeds into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.64F465D465EBF4FB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sheep Seeds"
	quest.650AE6855EB4D7B6.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Armadillo Seeds. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
