	quest.66C2B02E47C7B363.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Discharger Niotic"
	quest.66CDD772F62C21B0.quest_desc: ["This Bank has 81 slots and can hold close to unlimited items."]
	quest.66CDD772F62C21B0.quest_subtitle: "The top Bank tier"
	quest.66F41E7315D542E5.quest_desc: ["Crafted by the Metallurgic Infuser this is the basis from which Steel Dust can be attained by reprocessing it in the Metallurgic Infuser."]
	quest.66F41E7315D542E5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Enriched Iron"
	quest.6708332772DCBEE4.quest_desc: ["Bring Crushing Wheel into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6708332772DCBEE4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Crushing Wheel"
	quest.67090FA3629FFCB9.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Aerial Pearl. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.67090FA3629FFCB9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Aerial Pearl"
	quest.673448ADEC2A5A85.quest_desc: ["You'll finally be able to construct a Nuclear Reactor that uses different types of Fluid and Fuel Rods to produce various gaseous fuels, Steam in massive quantities, and radioactive materials. The Nuclear Reactor is not for the faint of heart. You'll need to keep watch on the gauges for thermal and neutron interaction when constructing one of four different sized reactors."]
	quest.673448ADEC2A5A85.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Nuclear Reactor, 27x Nuclear Alloy Machine Casing Pipe and 77x Nuclear Casing"
	quest.673448ADEC2A5A85.title: "Nuclear Reactor"
	quest.673526545A09C2CC.quest_desc: ["This device separates incoming air into hot and cold components, with one side becoming hot and the other cold. The amount of air used depends on the pressure. For optimal efficiency, be aware that there is a minor thermal connection between the hot and cold sides. To make the most of the heat, vent the cold side with a Heat Sink, and do the opposite if you want to maximize the cold."]
	quest.673526545A09C2CC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Vortex Tube"
	quest.675291ECEC4EAE0B.quest_desc: ["Find a city in the Nether."]
	quest.675291ECEC4EAE0B.quest_subtitle: "Enter a Nether City"
	quest.67643B27D0426FFE.quest_desc: ["The Personal Chest gives you a private storage space that stays with you wherever you go. Unlike a normal chest, its contents can be accessed from any Personal Chest linked to you, making it perfect for keeping frequently used items close at hand. Use it as your personal stash for tools, building materials, or anything else you don't want cluttering your inventory."]
	quest.67643B27D0426FFE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Personal Chest"
	quest.67671BD4A0BC0AAA.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Spawn Egg Configurable Bee. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.67671BD4A0BC0AAA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Spawn Egg Configurable Bee"
	quest.678BC8459EA2CB5E.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for White Willow Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.678BC8459EA2CB5E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain White Willow Sapling"
	quest.67901E9D344FFB3B.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.67901E9D344FFB3B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Sawing Factory"
