	quest.694EC4445C182219.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Air Compressor"
	quest.695217245E1FF9F5.quest_desc: ["Logistics frames handle logistics tasks in a network, using drones or pipes pressurized to at least 3 bar. A Logistics Wrench is needed to work with them." "Frames pass items in order of priority. Active provider frames push to requester, storage and default storage frames. Default storage frames push to requester and storage frames and accept from active providers. Storage frames push to requesters and accept from active providers and default frames. Passive frames only push to requesters. Requester frames accept from active provider, passive and storage frames." "Filters control what each frame pushes or accepts, and requester frames can also set a desired amount. Overlapping filters can add up. Nothing is transported if no inventory or tank in the network has room."]
	quest.695217245E1FF9F5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Logistics Frame Active Provider, Logistics Frame Default Storage, Logistics Frame Passive Provider and 2 more items"
	quest.695217245E1FF9F5.title: "Logistics Frames"
	quest.695C3AFD2AC5E607.quest_desc: ["The Mummy simply fights your enemies in hand-to-hand combat."]
	quest.695C3AFD2AC5E607.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Familiar Mummy"
