	quest.6D39E8BD0BD78A8E.quest_desc: ["The Library of Alexandria greatly expands how many enchantments you can store. It pairs well with the Tome of Extraction for moving enchantments off existing gear into your collection."]
	quest.6D39E8BD0BD78A8E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ender Library"
	quest.6D3BF32E8DAF8F91.quest_desc: ["Janitor spirits can pick up items and deposit them into containers. They're particularly useful to gather the products of other spirits."]
	quest.6D3BF32E8DAF8F91.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Book of Binding Bound Foliot, Brush, Dispenser and Hopper. Earn the advancement: Summon Foliot Cleaner"
	quest.6D3BF32E8DAF8F91.title: "Ritual: Summon Foliot Janitor"
	quest.6D593EE9664927ED.quest_desc: ["Used to store power, you will need to get yourself a FE Cell Housing."]
	quest.6D593EE9664927ED.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Insulating Resin"
	quest.6D66859037ADC9B0.quest_desc: ["Adds a smoker to the storage."]
	quest.6D66859037ADC9B0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smoking Upgrade"
	quest.6D68225D5481E46D.quest_desc: ["Use it to make fish fillets. The amount you get depends on the type of fish."]
	quest.6D68225D5481E46D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Diamond Fillet Knife"
	quest.6D6A8C839BA1FEBC.quest_desc: ["It is found in Aurora Palaces. It fires like a normal bow, but a hit swaps your place with the target. Be careful where that leaves you."]
	quest.6D6A8C839BA1FEBC.quest_subtitle: "Find the Ender Bow"
	quest.6D6A8C839BA1FEBC.title: "The Ender Bow"
	quest.6D6D9842CFD8C951.quest_desc: ["Bring Ice Seeds into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6D6D9842CFD8C951.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ice Seeds"
	quest.6D7235B9B9C960DD.quest_desc: ["The Gas-Burning Generator can use a plethora of flammable gases to generate electricity. Gases like Hydrogen and Ethene can be good for a large amount of power early on. Check your EMI to see which gases are truly flammable and how much power you can generate with them."]
	quest.6D7235B9B9C960DD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gas Burning Generator"
	quest.6D7235B9B9C960DD.title: "Gas-Burning Generator"
	quest.6D8991B1B64AAF0F.quest_desc: ["The Questing Ram lives in the Quest Grove, found in the Enchanted Forest biome. Do not kill it." "Give it wool of every color, either by dropping the wool under the ram or using it on him. Each color adds a stripe to his body. When the quest is complete he drops a trophy."]
	quest.6D8991B1B64AAF0F.quest_subtitle: "Get the Questing Ram trophy"
	quest.6D8991B1B64AAF0F.title: "Questing Ram"
	quest.6D8BE79061F0CC20.quest_desc: ["The Apprentice Spellbook is a better book and requires a trip to the Nether."]
	quest.6D8BE79061F0CC20.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gold Spell Book"
	quest.6D96DFC86C32B8BB.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Seed Reprocessor. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6D96DFC86C32B8BB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Seed Reprocessor"
	quest.6D998327C7098C51.quest_desc: ["This spirit will bring back random ores - including deepslate ores."]
	quest.6D998327C7098C51.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Miner Afrit Deeps"
	quest.6DCD49C382DB1C9C.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Mango Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6DCD49C382DB1C9C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mango Sapling"
	quest.6DE384270098B0D5.quest_desc: ["Transmits energy from the attached source to any power consumer within an offset AOE."]
	quest.6DE384270098B0D5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energytransmitter"
	quest.6E0AFC4F93A709DE.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Yew Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.6E0AFC4F93A709DE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Yew Sapling"
	quest.6E1B7E482248CD70.quest_desc: ["Arcane stone is used for crafting items from Ars Nouveau. You may also want to use this in your Ars Nouveau magical area."]
	quest.6E1B7E482248CD70.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 8x Sourcestone"
	quest.6E1B7E482248CD70.title: "Sourcestone"
	quest.6E2020218315C399.quest_desc: ["Processes resource combs into resources and honey. It holds 10 buckets of liquid and outputs fluid to any fluid storage block next to it. It also separates genetic material from bee material bottles into genes."]
	quest.6E2020218315C399.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Centrifuge"
	quest.6E3E4E3C6CE74A69.quest_desc: ["A simple generator that makes power from coal and other solid fuels."]
	quest.6E3E4E3C6CE74A69.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Generatort1"
	quest.6E43042D3CEE208D.quest_desc: ["Bring Minnow into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6E43042D3CEE208D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Minnow"
	quest.6E45DE5B628038D1.quest_desc: ["Whilst in the Nether, you must fight your way to the Hogs, and obtain Hogskin."]
	quest.6E45DE5B628038D1.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Hoglin"
	quest.6E5CD41866DE6111.quest_desc: ["A key piece of most Create builds: interchanges axis of rotational motion between one plane and another."]
	quest.6E5CD41866DE6111.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gearbox"
	quest.6E6769A01053B690.quest_desc: ["There may be other ways to make more power in modded, but it is hard to top the satisfaction of a boiler driving many Steam Engines… as many as you can setup fed with enough heat and water."]
	quest.6E6769A01053B690.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Steam Engine"
	quest.6E6A0D502DFCC952.quest_desc: ["The Sky Steel Ingot can be used to craft MEGA Item Storage cells. It is made by dropping Charged Certus Quartz, Iron, and Sky Stone into water. The Sky Osmium Ingot can be used to craft MEGA Chemical Storage cells. It is made by dropping Charged Certus Quartz, Osmium, and Sky Stone into water. The Sky Bronze Ingot can be used to craft MEGA Fluid Storage cells. It is made by dropping Charged Certus Quartz, Copper, and Sky Stone into water."]
	quest.6E6A0D502DFCC952.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sky Steel Ingot, Sky Bronze Ingot and Sky Osmium Ingot"
	quest.6E6B1DFAFF693FAA.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Capacitor Spirited. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6E6B1DFAFF693FAA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Capacitor Spirited"
	quest.6E6DE23E9CCF1E39.quest_desc: ["Bring Soul Sand Nest into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6E6DE23E9CCF1E39.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Soul Sand Nest"
	quest.6E703B6CB23A1180.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Energized Steel Seeds. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6E703B6CB23A1180.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energized Steel Seeds"
	quest.6E87762F6639137B.quest_desc: ["Try every food that is exclusive to the Twilight Forest."]
	quest.6E87762F6639137B.quest_subtitle: "Eat all the Twilight Forest foods"
	quest.6E8BC6B8B1890312.quest_desc: ["The Osmium Compressor is used to create Refined Obsidian Ingots from Refined Obsidian Dust and Glowstone Ingots from Glowstone Dust. It fuses liquid Osmium (melted down Osmium Ingots placed in the machine's bottom slot) with the originating materials to create their corresponding ingots."]
	quest.6E8BC6B8B1890312.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Osmium Compressor"
	quest.6E90FA61DB81B8BC.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Imperium Gemstone. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6E90FA61DB81B8BC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Imperium Gemstone"
	quest.6E9F5C14939476E4.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Ghast Seeds. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.6E9F5C14939476E4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ghast Seeds"
	quest.6EA2495260EAC420.quest_desc: ["Bring Minigun into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6EA2495260EAC420.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Minigun"
	quest.6EA8CCAF032487D3.quest_desc: ["The Large Steam Furnace can smelt recipes in batches of up to 8 at a 25% deduction of EU cost. Keep in mind, it will not do a mix of recipes, they must be the same type. If not, each type of recipe will be split into their batch of a max of 8."]
	quest.6EA8CCAF032487D3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Large Steam Furnace, 16x Bronze Plated Bricks, 7x Fire Clay Bricks and 2 more items"
	quest.6EABD47309F354DD.quest_desc: ["You'll want to craft a Pattern Encoding Terminal to be able to encode patterns with crafting recipes for your autocrafting system. The Pattern Access Terminal is another upgrade or the Terminal. This Terminal will allow you to make a Pattern of items you want your system to craft."]
	quest.6EABD47309F354DD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pattern Encoding Terminal and Pattern Access Terminal"
	quest.6EABD47309F354DD.title: "Pattern Encoding Terminal"
	quest.6EB4CFA725680541.quest_desc: ["Actually does nothing on it's own.. but is a key ingredient in making other desirable stuff. Also maybe the first thing you will want to build a contraption to make."]
	quest.6EB4CFA725680541.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Precision Mechanism"
	quest.6EB8725CD38955BC.quest_desc: ["Bring Neptunium Fishing Rod into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6EB8725CD38955BC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Neptunium Fishing Rod"
	quest.6EBF12BBAB828C1B.quest_desc: ["Feeds the player from food in the storage."]
	quest.6EBF12BBAB828C1B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Feeding Upgrade"
	quest.6ECAED363B693583.quest_desc: ["A Sigil of Socketing adds another socket to compatible Affix Gear, making room for one more Gem."]
	quest.6ECAED363B693583.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sigil of Socketing"
	quest.6ECAED363B693583.title: "More Room"
	quest.6ECF9993595C000E.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Supremium Helmet, Supremium Chestplate, Supremium Leggings and Supremium Boots. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.6ECF9993595C000E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Supremium Helmet, Supremium Chestplate, Supremium Leggings and Supremium Boots"
	quest.6ECF9993595C000E.title: "Supremium Armor"
	quest.6EEC0078D6A23658.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Mystical Fertilizer. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.6EEC0078D6A23658.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mystical Fertilizer"
	quest.6EF2D4401AAFD366.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.6EF2D4401AAFD366.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Sensitive"
	quest.6F0AA458CD49A86C.quest_desc: ["Filters items being piped in/out."]
	quest.6F0AA458CD49A86C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Filter Upgrade"
	quest.6F0B6FF4B75E8D66.quest_desc: ["An advanced compressor that utilizes sunlight to pressurize air. Its efficiency improves as it gets hotter, but excessive heat buildup will cause the compressor to shut down, necessitating manual repair."]
	quest.6F0B6FF4B75E8D66.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Solar Compressor"
	quest.6F0E941A3F0A6300.quest_desc: ["The Chemical Infuser combines or reacts two gases to create another gas. The gas gauges on the left and right side of its GUI are the input tanks, and correspond to correspond with the left and right sides of the machine. The gauge in the middle is for the resulting gas, which likewise is output through the front of the machine."]
	quest.6F0E941A3F0A6300.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chemical Infuser"
	quest.6F3E82436B6DCD42.quest_desc: ["A Bank Dock can be placed in the world and works like a chest while a Bank sits inside it."]
	quest.6F3E82436B6DCD42.quest_subtitle: "Place a Bank in a chest-like dock"
	quest.6F43A73447924D09.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Titanium Ingot. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6F43A73447924D09.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Titanium Ingot"
	quest.6F43A73447924D09.title: "Steel but Pink"
	quest.6F67CAC027801375.quest_desc: ["Give this scroll to a starbuncle, and it will help keep you further organized."]
	quest.6F67CAC027801375.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Deny Scroll"
	quest.6F68802E3CECA25D.quest_desc: ["To establish a Mercurial Logistics network, these Wires must be used to link between in- and outputs. Connection Nodes allow for multiple wires to converge to one point, if needed."]
	quest.6F68802E3CECA25D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Logistics Connector Node and Copper Wire"
	quest.6F68802E3CECA25D.title: "Mercurial Connections"
	quest.6F713004201B6207.quest_desc: ["An upgraded Basic Control Circuit, used in many tier 2 machines and items."]
	quest.6F713004201B6207.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Control Circuit"
	quest.6F810D21904F00B6.quest_desc: ["Bring Holly Sapling into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6F810D21904F00B6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Holly Sapling"
	quest.6F9082A1F400E5D3.quest_desc: ["Upgrade those Large Steam Boilers already! This advanced version can quadruple the Steam production to 1024 mb/t of steam at full temperature. It's a little taller so remember to use the Wrench to see multiblock shape and block placement."]
	quest.6F9082A1F400E5D3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Large Steam Boiler"
	quest.6F9082A1F400E5D3.title: "Advanced Large Steam Boiler"
	quest.6F9AEFBE29744AE4.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Zebrano Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6F9AEFBE29744AE4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Zebrano Sapling"
	quest.6FBFBC067DD3FD2A.quest_desc: ["Bring Pistachio Sapling into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6FBFBC067DD3FD2A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pistachio Sapling"
	quest.6FD1D4CDDE2DFD69.quest_desc: ["The Actuator's storage space is limited by default. Stabilizers strengthen its link to the storage dimension so it can store more."]
	quest.6FD1D4CDDE2DFD69.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Storage Stabilizer Tier4"
	quest.6FD8B163635D5992.quest_desc: ["Cuts down even the tallest trees, or cuts many things into.. many more things. So many recipes apply for many possible inputs to the Mechanical Saw, that you'll want to lock in the recipe by hitting the top of it with an example of the desired output."]
	quest.6FD8B163635D5992.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mechanical Saw"
	quest.6FDB74D30B768032.quest_desc: ["Bring Icestone into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.6FDB74D30B768032.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Icestone"
	quest.6FDB74D30B768032.title: "Cold as Ice"
	quest.6FDEAD51DB6A6F36.quest_desc: ["Some quests reward a T3 Codex (Ancient Codex Entry). T3 Codexes do not spawn naturally."]
	quest.6FDEAD51DB6A6F36.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Split, Glyph Blink, Glyph Burst and 13 more items"
	quest.6FDEAD51DB6A6F36.title: "Tier 3 Glyphs"
	quest.6FF0A56C73DEA914.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Rowan Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.6FF0A56C73DEA914.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rowan Sapling"
	quest.700FCEDBE64F3313.quest_desc: ["MekaSuit can be upgraded with Modules that are installed with the Modification Station."]
	quest.700FCEDBE64F3313.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mekasuit Boots"
	quest.7014B2366D779AE2.quest_desc: ["The Charger turns Certus Quartz into Charged Certus Quartz and recharges tools and items that use AE power. The Crank powers it by hand, so you can use it before you have any other power."]
	quest.7014B2366D779AE2.title: "Charger"
	quest.70211D7B2E93E8DE.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Solar Panel Starter. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.70211D7B2E93E8DE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Solar Panel Starter"
	quest.702506FB0F4559A7.quest_desc: ["An Energy Cube is an advanced type of battery that is compatible with multiple energy systems."]
	quest.702506FB0F4559A7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Energy Cube"
	quest.702984EE8F429BEA.quest_desc: ["Bring Thread Gliding into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.702984EE8F429BEA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thread Gliding"
	quest.7047A0BAF1E7C171.quest_desc: ["Plain ol' Cardboard. So basic, and yet.."]
	quest.7047A0BAF1E7C171.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cardboard"
	quest.7067FBA480B8B646.quest_desc: ["The rarest of them all, Precious resources are often of exceptional value."]
	quest.7067FBA480B8B646.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Alchemical Sulfur Iesnium, Alchemical Sulfur Emerald, Alchemical Sulfur Diamond and Alchemical Sulfur Netherite"
	quest.7067FBA480B8B646.title: "Precious Sulfurs"
	quest.707123C855FC3A68.quest_desc: ["It drops from the Snow Queen and helps if your aim is poor. Enchanting it with Power V makes it as strong as the Tri-Bow."]
	quest.707123C855FC3A68.quest_subtitle: "Get the Seeker Bow"
	quest.707123C855FC3A68.title: "The Seeker Bow"
	quest.7071E4442193DCC8.quest_desc: ["A reinforced version of the Basic Pressure Tube, these can be camouflaged and have Tube Modules added to provide extra functionality."]
	quest.7071E4442193DCC8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Reinforced Pressure Tube"
	quest.707AC1502CB5CC38.quest_desc: ["Bring Awakened Supremium Helmet, Awakened Supremium Chestplate, Awakened Supremium Leggings and Awakened Supremium Boots into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.707AC1502CB5CC38.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Awakened Supremium Helmet, Awakened Supremium Chestplate, Awakened Supremium Leggings and Awakened Supremium Boots"
	quest.707AC1502CB5CC38.title: "Awakened Supremium Armor"
	quest.707E0F4AC4A3468F.quest_desc: ["A Bottle o' Lightning is obtained by Right-Clicking a bottle on a charged creeper."]
	quest.707E0F4AC4A3468F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Lightning Bottle"
	quest.7080BBF387CF1381.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Mv Steam Turbine. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7080BBF387CF1381.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mv Steam Turbine"
	quest.7080BBF387CF1381.title: "Better Than Wind Mills"
	quest.708B451E3FFBE2B9.quest_desc: ["For the Electric Chain Saw: Press Left Shift and Right Click to swap between Fortune/Looting and Silk Touch. For the Electric Mining Drill: Press Left Shift and Right Click to swap between Fortune and Silk Touch. For Both: Use Alt and Mouse Scroll to change mining speeds."]
	quest.708B451E3FFBE2B9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Electric Chainsaw and Electric Mining Drill"
	quest.708B451E3FFBE2B9.title: "Electric Accessories"
	quest.709902273BED82EB.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Prudentium Watering Can. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.709902273BED82EB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Prudentium Watering Can"
	quest.70AB7073F3E04EA6.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Configurable Honeycomb. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.70AB7073F3E04EA6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.70B98506E050EED0.quest_desc: ["Lignite is a truly abundant fuel source that can be found in the world. It's pretty much Coal, but brown. It has a lower carbon content despite burning the same amount as Coal; created the same way too. This means you can keep your real Coal for other projects or recipes, keep Lignite to fuel your Steam Mining Drill instead."]
	quest.70B98506E050EED0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 64x Lignite Coal"
	quest.70B98506E050EED0.title: "Lignite Coal"
	quest.70CEB03E6D7FD326.quest_desc: ["Bring Red Delicious Apple Sapling into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.70CEB03E6D7FD326.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Red Delicious Apple Sapling"
	quest.70D45EF935FBEB29.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for End Seeds. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.70D45EF935FBEB29.quest_subtitle: "Obtain End Seeds"
	quest.70D80C15C1E42E9E.quest_desc: ["Bring Fluix Dust into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.70D80C15C1E42E9E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fluix Dust"
	quest.70D9DF4A9E061CEB.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Synodontis. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.70D9DF4A9E061CEB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Synodontis"
	quest.70EF2EEA2EA17121.quest_desc: ["An utility head armor piece, used in conjunction with the Scuba Tank to breathe underwater. It can be enchanted with respiration and water breathing for extended use."]
	quest.70EF2EEA2EA17121.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Scuba Mask"
	quest.7107506BF772DD74.quest_desc: ["The Enchantment Library stores enchanted books so you can retrieve them later, without filling your storage with books."]
	quest.7107506BF772DD74.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Library"
	quest.7115C45F384550B7.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Sealed Sword. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7115C45F384550B7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sealed Sword"
	quest.712331CFE1AA1774.quest_desc: ["The Matter Condenser will allow you to make Matter Balls for the Paint Gun, and make Singularities at the cost of item entities."]
	quest.712331CFE1AA1774.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Condenser"
	quest.712DC413A1DABC9F.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Pomegranate Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.712DC413A1DABC9F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pomegranate Sapling"
	quest.715C6089ADFFA16B.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Energy Hopper Nitro. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.715C6089ADFFA16B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Hopper Nitro"
	quest.7195E352119B893E.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Concentration Amulet. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7195E352119B893E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Concentration Amulet"
