	quest.71B13BEA19B4BCF8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pecan Sapling"
	quest.71DBE4620D736352.quest_desc: ["Slowly restores hunger while walking on grass."]
	quest.71DBE4620D736352.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rooted Boots"
	quest.71F3355F7329434D.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Horn of the Wild Hunter. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.71F3355F7329434D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Horn of the Wild Hunter"
	quest.71FB339EBF50F9A6.quest_desc: ["This helps locate budding amethyst and magical creatures within a 75 block radius."]
	quest.71FB339EBF50F9A6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dowsing Rod"
	quest.721BBDF08D8B5B61.quest_desc: ["Bring Energy Discharger Basic into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.721BBDF08D8B5B61.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Discharger Basic"
	quest.721EBB4B78B425A7.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: Aether Champion."]
	quest.721EBB4B78B425A7.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Aether Champion"
	quest.7230F1A546BEEB0B.quest_desc: ["Bring Olive Sapling into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7230F1A546BEEB0B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Olive Sapling"
	quest.7232D8F8AC59C7B6.quest_desc: ["Tier 2 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.7232D8F8AC59C7B6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Smelt"
	quest.723DFC38D29BBDC9.quest_desc: ["Bring Distillery into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.723DFC38D29BBDC9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Distillery"
	quest.723DFC38D29BBDC9.title: "Al Capone Approves"
	quest.724765B7DA80CECF.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Steeleaf Helmet, Steeleaf Chestplate, Steeleaf Leggings and Steeleaf Boots. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.724765B7DA80CECF.quest_subtitle: "Craft a full set of Steeleaf Armor"
	quest.724765B7DA80CECF.title: "Steeleaf Armorer"
	quest.725ABB2AEA4B1E1D.quest_desc: ["It can be a hassle to harvest Otherwood saplings - as they are unstable, you can only see and harvest them while under the Third Eye. This trade spirit fixes that little problem, by exchanging your unstable saplings with ones that need no Third Eye to interact with."]
	quest.725ABB2AEA4B1E1D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Book of Binding Bound Foliot, Oak Sapling, Birch Sapling and 2 more items. Earn the advancement: Summon Foliot Sapling Trader"
	quest.725ABB2AEA4B1E1D.title: "Ritual: Summon Otherworld Sapling Trader"
	quest.726561C06E98328A.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: Progress Ur Ghast."]
	quest.726561C06E98328A.quest_subtitle: "Touch the Ur-Ghast's tears"
	quest.7269C90D724A67F6.quest_desc: ["Used in the creation of some glyphs."]
	quest.7269C90D724A67F6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Earth Essence"
	quest.72750076B9971EC5.quest_desc: ["Pumps fluid between the tank upgrade and adjacent blocks."]
	quest.72750076B9971EC5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pump Upgrade"
	quest.72805EEF37B00307.quest_desc: ["A decorative lighting choice from Ars Nouveau."]
	quest.72805EEF37B00307.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sconce"
	quest.728E96063D7A6B3E.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Thermo Generator Spirited. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.728E96063D7A6B3E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thermo Generator Spirited"
	quest.72B1B1FF2FB91137.quest_desc: ["Bring Imperium Watering Can into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.72B1B1FF2FB91137.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Imperium Watering Can"
	quest.72C54536C81BB476.quest_desc: ["Yellow Cake is obtained by putting Uranium Ingots in the Enrichment Chamber. Yellow Cake will be needed to make Fissile Fuel for the Fission Reactor."]
	quest.72C54536C81BB476.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Yellow Cake Uranium"
	quest.72D18B947FE41BE3.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Red Crepe Myrtle Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.72D18B947FE41BE3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Red Crepe Myrtle Sapling"
	quest.72E0EC631DAC1513.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: Black Moa."]
	quest.72E0EC631DAC1513.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Black Moa"
	quest.72E31A9E5B6E8E20.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Configurable Honeycomb. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.72E31A9E5B6E8E20.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.72EB399A714D6B45.quest_desc: ["You know how placing one chest next to another can form a double chest? Well Vaults are like that, but up to 81 vaults can be combined together. The catch? You can't look inside them directly. Get things in and out with Chutes, Hatches, Funnels, and Packagers. Tip: see the Inventory Ticker for Create's great take on a storage terminal."]
	quest.72EB399A714D6B45.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Item Vault"
	quest.72F47E08EC9820A4.quest_desc: ["Bring Thermoelectric Plate into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.72F47E08EC9820A4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Thermoelectric Plate"
	quest.72F4D17AAB9039B0.quest_desc: ["This device spawns mobs using pressure, bypassing light-level restrictions and enabling redstone control. It requires a Spawner Core to function. Be aware that a partially empty Spawner Core will result in reduced efficiency."]
	quest.72F4D17AAB9039B0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pressurized Spawner"
	quest.7308408DF2D17B69.quest_desc: ["Shelves are the foundation of an Apothic Enchanting setup. There are 32 valid shelf positions around the table, and each shelf needs an air block between it and the table to count." "Eterna sets the available enchantment level and power. Quanta changes the enchantment pool, but too much makes weaker enchantments more likely. Arcana influences the rarity and quality of enchantments. Each shelf has its own Eterna cap, and anything above it is ignored." "Try different shelf combinations to find the right balance."]
	quest.7308408DF2D17B69.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.7308408DF2D17B69.title: "Bookshelves"
	quest.7309FF5CF1382CC4.quest_desc: ["Spiritfire is a special kind of flame that can transform some objects into others. You can make some by throwing a Demon's Dream fruit on the ground, and lighting it on fire. You can throw Andesite into it to receive Otherstone, and Oak Saplings to receive Otherworld Saplings."]
	quest.7309FF5CF1382CC4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Otherstone and Otherworld Sapling Natural"
	quest.7309FF5CF1382CC4.title: "Spiritfire"
	quest.731343AE541DE305.quest_desc: ["Alternative to the Quantum Ring. Has limited range of 1000 blocks, unlike the Quantum Ring."]
	quest.731343AE541DE305.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wireless Connect and Wireless Tool"
	quest.731E63F6EF9320ED.quest_desc: ["Bring Raw Iridium into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.731E63F6EF9320ED.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Raw Iridium"
	quest.731E63F6EF9320ED.title: "Diamond 2.0: Electric Boogaloo"
	quest.733E17B7A8D38AF8.quest_desc: ["Bring Emerald Seeds into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.733E17B7A8D38AF8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Emerald Seeds"
	quest.733E3A8C7B5AAC69.quest_desc: ["Bring Inferium Helmet, Inferium Chestplate, Inferium Leggings and Inferium Boots into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.733E3A8C7B5AAC69.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Inferium Helmet, Inferium Chestplate, Inferium Leggings and Inferium Boots"
	quest.733E3A8C7B5AAC69.title: "Inferium Armor"
	quest.7368C5F4DEDE02DA.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Fluorite Seeds. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7368C5F4DEDE02DA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fluorite Seeds"
	quest.737205B6431E1110.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Crystal Spirited. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.737205B6431E1110.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Crystal Spirited"
	quest.73893F32A771FD27.quest_desc: ["Variants to find: Jungle, Nether, Icy and Desert."]
	quest.73893F32A771FD27.quest_subtitle: "Find all 4 Monument variants"
	quest.73B0D3914092EC3E.quest_desc: ["Bring Configurable Honeycomb into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.73B0D3914092EC3E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.73D03096609B274E.quest_desc: ["Bring Eclipsealloy Leggings into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.73D03096609B274E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Eclipsealloy Leggings"
	quest.73D44417EA546403.quest_desc: ["The Logic Press is used in an Inscriber to turn Gold into a Printed Logic Circuit. Presses are found in meteorites, and the Inscriber can duplicate one with an Iron Block."]
	quest.73F1D97AF9D33D65.quest_desc: ["Rechiseled adds additional decorative block variants. Browse its crafting options to find coordinated textures for your builds."]
	quest.73F1D97AF9D33D65.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.740753C7869E8F16.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Dragon Egg Seeds. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.740753C7869E8F16.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dragon Egg Seeds"
	quest.740CA0BB081DB68C.quest_desc: ["Construction Sticks helps place repeated blocks more quickly. Explore its placement behavior for walls, floors, and other building tasks."]
	quest.740CA0BB081DB68C.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.741A2E8C7E2BC6FD.quest_desc: ["Notable rituals: Binding turns special mobs into familiars. Containment traps entities in a Jar of Containment. Challenge summons a raid when used in a village. Flight grants creative flight within about 60 blocks. Summon Wilden summons wilden mobs, including the Chimera if augmented."]
	quest.741A2E8C7E2BC6FD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ritual Challenge, Ritual Binding, Ritual Flight and 6 more items"
	quest.741A2E8C7E2BC6FD.title: "Purple Tablets"
	quest.7420A81F7BDFF713.quest_desc: ["Dry Ice gives your reactor the best cooling."]
	quest.7420A81F7BDFF713.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dry Ice"
	quest.742522CCADD8D349.quest_desc: ["The most powerful controlled spirit of all, Marid offer many benefits to master summoners."]
	quest.742522CCADD8D349.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Book of Binding Marid"
	quest.7429C528F6279261.quest_desc: ["Search the Twilight Forest for everything that comes from trees: saplings, leaves, slabs and every other wood item. Craft it, loot it, or find it."]
	quest.7429C528F6279261.quest_subtitle: "Collect everything that comes from trees"
	quest.7432202F127281C8.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Smart Filter. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7432202F127281C8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.7432202F127281C8.title: "Leggins"
	quest.743D2FBBE95AE443.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Steel Wiremill. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.743D2FBBE95AE443.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Steel Wiremill"
	quest.743D2FBBE95AE443.title: "Neither a Wire nor a Mill"
	quest.743D6326A9572107.quest_desc: ["This cell can store radioactive chemicals, unlike the regular Chemical Storage Cell. Needs to be partitioned before you can use it."]
	quest.743D6326A9572107.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Radioactive Chemical Cell"
	quest.743FB39F466AD219.quest_desc: ["The Electric Bow works like the vanilla Bow and shoots normal Arrows. The difference is, that every shot doesn't damage, but discharges the bow. If the internal energy storage is empty, the bow doesn't work and needs to be recharged e.g. on a Basic Energy Cube."]
	quest.743FB39F466AD219.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Electric Bow"
	quest.744A46E122AAB6FE.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.744A46E122AAB6FE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Harvest"
	quest.744BA04736CC3AA9.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Rose Gum Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.744BA04736CC3AA9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rose Gum Sapling"
	quest.745A895DB39AB45F.quest_desc: ["Smelts 192 items."]
	quest.745A895DB39AB45F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Insanium Coal"
	quest.745C8130B75C03F6.quest_desc: ["Can by Dyed and Trimmed! Toggle Creative Flight by pressing N."]
	quest.745C8130B75C03F6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Nano Gravichestplate"
	quest.747A44CBD0D9D80F.quest_desc: ["Rare resources take more effort to find or to create, and are in some cases not found in nature."]
	quest.747A44CBD0D9D80F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Alchemical Sulfur Platinum, Alchemical Sulfur Silver, Alchemical Sulfur Uranium and 5 more items"
	quest.747A44CBD0D9D80F.title: "Rare Sulfurs"
	quest.74887E460F06E36B.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.74887E460F06E36B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Craft"
	quest.74922CD545618585.quest_desc: ["The Cooking Table is where you prepare food using ingredients from the kitchen blocks around it."]
	quest.74922CD545618585.quest_subtitle: "The heart of your kitchen"
	quest.74A344692DDC46B8.quest_desc: ["This machine uses advanced technology to compress items down to atomic size, allowing it to access and manipulate a player’s inventory directly. Items can be input and output via hoppers, and they will be added to or removed from the inventory of the player who placed the machine. You can also use smarter insertion methods, such as Drones or Logistics Frames, or other mods, to automatically manage the player's inventory, like keeping it stocked with 64 torches, for instance."]
	quest.74A344692DDC46B8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Aerial Interface"
	quest.74A946BAD3F975DF.quest_desc: ["Pay attention: it might make one thing on a Depot, and another in a Basin."]
	quest.74A946BAD3F975DF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mechanical Press"
	quest.74BF5D78022B1402.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Steel Ingot. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.74BF5D78022B1402.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Steel Ingot"
	quest.74C2921884820E96.quest_desc: ["Aviar's Circle is the first pentacle you will prepare. It is for summoning Foliot. Refer to the Dictionary of Spirits for how to lay it out."]
	quest.74C2921884820E96.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chalk White, Smart Filter, Golden Sacrificial Bowl and 6x Sacrificial Bowl"
	quest.74C2921884820E96.title: "Aviar's Circle"
	quest.74C90AF76F9F39E4.quest_desc: ["Use it to fill your moat, drain a swamp, pump water or lava without limit."]
	quest.74C90AF76F9F39E4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Hose Pulley"
	quest.74DC153CDFBA4270.quest_desc: ["The Steel Alloy Smelter allows you to create alloys from two different ingots without needing to mix the dusts in a Mixer first. Check your EMI to see which alloys can be made this way. You can also use any combination of equal amounts of resources to create an alloy, such as nine tiny dust + nine nuggets. What you cannot do is nine tiny dust + one ingot, as the amounts are different."]
	quest.74DC153CDFBA4270.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Steel Alloy Smelter"
	quest.74E85AA325F1FA7D.quest_desc: ["A unique axe dropped by the Minoshroom."]
	quest.74E85AA325F1FA7D.quest_subtitle: "Get the Diamond Minotaur Axe"
	quest.74EC653C3DFF15EB.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Balsam Fir Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.74EC653C3DFF15EB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Balsam Fir Sapling"
	quest.74FEE5E4E73AE4D8.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Rotten Spell Book. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.74FEE5E4E73AE4D8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rotten Spell Book"
	quest.7505D3C0A8577B60.quest_desc: ["Chemical Tanks are Mekanism's batteries for storing Gases. They can be placed as a block and do interact with Pressurized Tubes. They come in the four levels, each increasing the storage capacity and output rate."]
	quest.7505D3C0A8577B60.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ultimate Chemical Tank"
	quest.750AD0EAFD7AC8E6.quest_desc: ["Bring Pacific Halibut into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.750AD0EAFD7AC8E6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pacific Halibut"
	quest.751144D1292A6218.quest_desc: ["Crush a Gem with an Anvil in the world to turn it into Gem Dust. Once you have crushed a few, you can use the Salvaging Table instead."]
	quest.751144D1292A6218.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gem Dust and Anvil"
	quest.752D6FA1C0B8E30F.quest_desc: ["Point 2 Point (P2P) Tunnels can be overwhelmingly complex, but at the same time extremely useful. These tunnels can be used to transfer up to 32 channels from one point to the other. But it's wildly inefficient. Those 32 channels get compacted into a single channel. This means, you can theoretically wire up 1,024 channels through a single dense cable, instead of only 32. You'll have to use the Memory Card to link up the tunnels together via frequencies. Shift-Right-Clicking on the \"entrace\" tunnel will set the memory card to that frequency. Right-Clicking on the \"exit\" tunnel with set the tunnel to the frequency of the \"entrance\" one. Keep in mind, you can have multiple \"exit\" tunnels so long as the total channels used between them don't go beyond the number of channels entered into the \"entrance\" tunnel. There are also different types of Point 2 Point Tunnels. Aside from one that carries ME Channels, there are ones that transfer raw power, fluids, items, light, and even redstone! They work the same way, aside from carrying channels. It takes some practice to use, so experiment with them first. Once you get the hang of it, your ME System will be looking more than professional!"]
	quest.752D6FA1C0B8E30F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Me P2p Tunnel"
	quest.752D6FA1C0B8E30F.title: "P2P"
	quest.7569E5A18129C681.quest_desc: ["Chemical Tanks are Mekanism's batteries for storing Gases. They can be placed as a block and do interact with Pressurized Tubes. They come in the four levels, each increasing the storage capacity and output rate."]
	quest.7569E5A18129C681.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Chemical Tank"
	quest.757395B08E2C21B5.quest_desc: ["The turbine is a multiblock added by Mekanism that can generate a load of power using steam. Steam can be created in various ways. Both reactors are a decent way, but you may, also, use the Boiler to create steam."]
	quest.757395B08E2C21B5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Turbine Casing"
	quest.7574A64692A5C7A6.quest_desc: ["Now you can make a large tank! This is a tank multi-block that can store 64,000mb per block within the total volume the tank takes up, air blocks and solid. When you place down a Large Tank, open its GUI and check out the top left. It'll let you choose which size you want. Once you've chosen, hold out your trusty wrench and a hologram will show you where to place blocks. Use a Large Tank Hatch too. It works just like other hatches, aside from it only being a point of access to the tank. It'll input and output from any hatches you put on it."]
	quest.7574A64692A5C7A6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Large Tank and Large Tank Hatch"
	quest.75D770DAAB018140.quest_desc: ["Reduces the probability of taking any damage by 25% for each piece of the Quantum Armor Set."]
	quest.75D770DAAB018140.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Quantum Chestplate"
	quest.75D770DAAB018140.title: "Quantum Immortality"
	quest.75ED69E18231F41C.quest_desc: ["The Stainless Steel Drill is a new drill that can be used in both the Quarry and the Oil Drilling Rig. For the quarry, you'll obtain some new rare resources that will be extremely beneficial for the future. In the drilling rig, you'll be able to pump out Shale Oil which can be distilled into Helium, Sulfuric Crude Oil, and Sulfuric Naphtha."]
	quest.75ED69E18231F41C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 4x Stainless Steel Drill"
	quest.75ED69E18231F41C.title: "Stainless Steel Drill"
	quest.7615DDC3B658B31C.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Configurable Honeycomb. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7615DDC3B658B31C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.76189167938C3130.quest_desc: ["Burns honey to produce power. Honey can be piped in, or honey bottles, blocks and buckets can be added in the GUI. It accepts two upgrades: Productivity lowers honey consumption, and Speed raises the output speed."]
	quest.76189167938C3130.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Honey Generator"
	quest.761C32656BB95304.quest_desc: ["An Induction battery is a large, long-term, multiblock battery that, depending on what's inside it, can store a massive amount of power."]
	quest.761C32656BB95304.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 32x Induction Casing, 2x Induction Port and Structural Glass"
	quest.762E163EFBE44BBF.quest_desc: ["Bring Ferricore Leggings into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.762E163EFBE44BBF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ferricore Leggings"
	quest.763D64561B2BA06B.quest_desc: ["Used for crafting wands, rituals and decoration. Archwood trees generate randomly in the world, and Archwood Saplings can also be bought at the Market from Farming for Blockheads."]
	quest.763D64561B2BA06B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blue Archwood Log, Purple Archwood Log, Green Archwood Log and Red Archwood Log"
	quest.763EA2539F967175.quest_desc: ["The Productivity upgrade will increase the number of combs a bee produces per trip."]
	quest.763EA2539F967175.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Upgrade Productivity 2"
	quest.763F16245FAEF950.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Item Storage Cell 256m. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.763F16245FAEF950.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Item Storage Cell 256m"
	quest.764476D35A55D9C6.quest_desc: ["Now that you're producing energy in the medium voltage tier, you'll need to make sure your machines can accept that new found power. Normally, cables will not even connect to machines if they aren't of the same tier. But, by placing an Advanced Machine Hull (or higher tier) into the slot in the top right of the machine, you'll have upgraded the machine to the tier of power it associates with it. By default, electric machines are already at the Basic Machine Hull tier and there is no need to put Basic Machine Hulls into the slot. Make sure you check for which machines actually need the upgrades so you aren't wasting resources on machines that don't really need the extra boost."]
	quest.764476D35A55D9C6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Machine Hull"
	quest.764476D35A55D9C6.title: "Hull Upgrades"
	quest.765420594DC733D1.quest_desc: ["Bring Solar Panel Nitro into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.765420594DC733D1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Solar Panel Nitro"
	quest.765F1F306BC7545D.quest_desc: ["Lets the wearer move freely in water."]
	quest.765F1F306BC7545D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Charm of Sinking"
	quest.7666ACA6FB7791F7.quest_desc: ["Bring Capacitor Niotic into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7666ACA6FB7791F7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Capacitor Niotic"
	quest.766ADA1FCA0604EC.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Celestigem Pickaxe. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.766ADA1FCA0604EC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Celestigem Pickaxe"
	quest.7677C5A5173195DE.quest_desc: ["Steeleaf is found in Labyrinth, Hollow Hill and Dark Tower chests. As a tool or armor it is as strong as diamond but less durable than iron."]
	quest.7677C5A5173195DE.quest_subtitle: "Get some Steeleaf"
	quest.768A0ADC0567A5CA.quest_desc: ["Expands the inventory of the shulker box."]
	quest.768A0ADC0567A5CA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gold Shulker Box"
	quest.769A0CE4777F8826.quest_desc: ["Simple version: breaks blocks, using a tool if you give it one, with speed and orientation controls and optional redstone sensitivity. Advanced version: adds filtering and offset AOE, and needs power."]
	quest.769A0CE4777F8826.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.76D07EE5DAFEA90D.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Honeycomb Ghostly. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.76D07EE5DAFEA90D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Honeycomb Ghostly"
	quest.76D2482C90266C3D.quest_desc: ["Adds a blast furnace to the backpack."]
	quest.76D2482C90266C3D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blasting Upgrade"
	quest.76E9C42F3D4011D0.quest_desc: ["Bring Configurable Honeycomb into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.76E9C42F3D4011D0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.76F76B9C1EE6DB62.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.76F76B9C1EE6DB62.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Ignite"
	quest.76FE0ED2B314DE22.quest_desc: ["Nuclear Waste can be processed in an Isotropic Centrifuge to make Plutonium. The Plutonium can be used to make a pellet. The pellet is used to make casing for another machine, or, reprocessed into more fuel."]
	quest.76FE0ED2B314DE22.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pellet Plutonium"
	quest.76FE4D9FF7B2DEC9.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Rabbit Seeds. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.76FE4D9FF7B2DEC9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rabbit Seeds"
	quest.771E4279E4352BC1.quest_desc: ["Bring Player Transmitter Niotic into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.771E4279E4352BC1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Player Transmitter Niotic"
	quest.772AD8376DD7E3DE.quest_desc: ["An upgrade already? Trying to take your house with you? Good idea! Tents tend to hurt backs."]
	quest.772AD8376DD7E3DE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Spatial Cell Component 16"
	quest.772AD8376DD7E3DE.title: "Medium Spatial Component"
	quest.7737C72546226B32.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.7737C72546226B32.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Injecting Factory"
	quest.7746747CC50E3F1B.quest_desc: ["Bring Ring of Thrift into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7746747CC50E3F1B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ring of Thrift"
	quest.7752170CD763C9D9.quest_desc: ["Defeat Apothecarist."]
	quest.7752170CD763C9D9.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Apothecarist"
	quest.775B1ED6F9A4EC5A.quest_desc: ["Ignites its target. Be cautious, it can also set fire to the surrounding environment!"]
	quest.775B1ED6F9A4EC5A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gun Ammo Incendiary"
	quest.776290E451C33C1A.quest_desc: ["Bring Kinetic Belt into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.776290E451C33C1A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Kinetic Belt"
	quest.7780ED6483FC9986.quest_desc: ["Time for that beautifully shining Orange Ingot? You'll need to grab some of the Copper and Tin dust you get from the Forge Hammer to make it. It's a simple mixture of 3:1 Copper to Tin in your crafting grid. Once you progress, you'll find a way to produce this mixture more efficiently since you're spilling some dust making it on hand. Remember that Steam Machines will accept inputs from any side, be it items, steam or another fluid. You can lock their slots by clicking on the padlock looking button in the interface. Locked slots will make sure the machine only accepts one type of item or fluid per slot. Every machine has an output side as well, and you can enable auto-output from inside the interface. Using your trusty Wrench you can adjust the output side with ease! If you don't want so many items in the slots at a time, use that Scroll Wheel of yours to adjust the maximum number of items stored at a time. P.S. Right clicking on a steam machine with gunpowder will double it's speed and steam consumption. Keep that in mind when looking at recipes. That gunpowder may just save you a trip to hell."]
	quest.7780ED6483FC9986.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 16x Bronze Ingot"
	quest.7780ED6483FC9986.title: "Your First Bronze"
	quest.7781942B1A14BD68.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Configurable Honeycomb. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7781942B1A14BD68.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.778D8C6EA2C66267.quest_desc: ["Screw a house, take your entire lair with you! But be warned, it won't be cheap!"]
	quest.778D8C6EA2C66267.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Spatial Cell Component 128"
	quest.778D8C6EA2C66267.title: "Large Spatial Component"
	quest.779AE73897718D2F.quest_desc: ["Bring Celestigem Chestplate into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.779AE73897718D2F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Celestigem Chestplate"
	quest.77A9AB166FA8A789.quest_desc: ["The boiler needs an input and output for the water and steam. Depending on how you're using the boiler, you may, also, need 2 more valves for coolant exchange. Begin with a 3x3 layer of casings. Then place the heating element in the center. Surround that in casings or reactor glass. The edges must be casings. Build another layer of casings with the pressure disperser on top of the heating element. Then cover it all up to with more casings. Mekanism has a decent Wiki if you have trouble with the structure."]
	quest.77A9AB166FA8A789.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 2x Boiler Valve, 32x Boiler Casing, 2x Reactor Glass and 2 more items"
	quest.77C87D1B3D283583.quest_desc: ["Bring Brown Amber Sapling into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.77C87D1B3D283583.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Brown Amber Sapling"
	quest.77F510BC1BD66741.quest_desc: ["The VoidShift Wand has Air Burst up to strength 4 and Void Shift, which teleports you up to 15 blocks."]
	quest.77F510BC1BD66741.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Voidshift Wand"
	quest.77FDFD4FD5C46D39.quest_desc: ["Honey Treats calm angry bees and make baby bees grow up faster. They can also be combined with genes to transfer genetics from one bee to another."]
	quest.77FDFD4FD5C46D39.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Honey Treat"
	quest.780EF8B9FD6437F4.quest_desc: ["You also need 2 unique legendary fish and 2 unique golden fish for the Gold Trophy."]
	quest.780EF8B9FD6437F4.quest_subtitle: "Catch 100 fish in total"
	quest.7817F46D48C398E2.quest_desc: ["Simple version: works in pairs and swaps blocks, air included. Entities teleport on their own. Has redstone sensitivity options. Advanced version: adds filtering and offset AOE, and needs power."]
	quest.7817F46D48C398E2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.782883242EF18A65.quest_desc: ["Tier 3 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.782883242EF18A65.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Glide"
	quest.782E726D920AB09C.quest_desc: ["(but really, with this you can transfer fluids to or from mobile contraptions and trains)."]
	quest.782E726D920AB09C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Portable Fluid Interface"
	quest.78335834458025F1.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Inductor. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.78335834458025F1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Inductor"
	quest.78335834458025F1.title: "The L in RLC"
	quest.78399D60F97240DC.quest_desc: ["Bring Configurable Honeycomb into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.78399D60F97240DC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.784334FD0614CDF0.quest_desc: ["This is standard Minigun Ammo with no special properties. However, it can be crafted with a Potion to imbue the Ammo with the potion's effects."]
	quest.784334FD0614CDF0.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gun Ammo"
	quest.7867CF2DB8DC10A5.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Almond Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7867CF2DB8DC10A5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Almond Sapling"
	quest.786D1CD2CAA19D15.quest_desc: ["The Logic Processor is made in an Inscriber from a Printed Logic Circuit, Printed Silicon and Redstone. It is used for buses, terminals and more."]
	quest.787A726BEEC0BB74.quest_desc: ["Craft any Rune that goes best with the magic armor or upgrade orb that you want."]
	quest.787A726BEEC0BB74.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.78940B88116D45F4.quest_desc: ["Bring Ceylon Ebony Sapling into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.78940B88116D45F4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ceylon Ebony Sapling"
	quest.7897E36F8F23152C.quest_desc: ["Create has trains. You need Sturdy Sheets to get started with them."]
	quest.7897E36F8F23152C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sturdy Sheet"
	quest.78A0AC192B39D776.quest_desc: ["Simple version: places blocks, with speed and orientation controls and optional redstone sensitivity. Advanced version: adds filtering and offset AOE, and needs power."]
	quest.78A0AC192B39D776.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.78B0C026C3A8AAEA.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Configurable Honeycomb. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.78B0C026C3A8AAEA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.78C4FC782DA6BB39.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Polarizer. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.78C4FC782DA6BB39.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Polarizer"
	quest.78C4FC782DA6BB39.title: "One Recipe (+2) To Rule Them All"
	quest.78C5BB7457C5BAE4.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Archmage Glove. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.78C5BB7457C5BAE4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Archmage Glove"
	quest.78CBBFEB45DC3232.quest_desc: ["Provides an occasional positive potion effect that last a little bit."]
	quest.78CBBFEB45DC3232.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Belt of Unstable Gifts"
	quest.78DB487D39F4F5E4.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Mechanical Piston. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.78DB487D39F4F5E4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mechanical Piston"
	quest.78E93EEB139A2DCF.quest_desc: ["Lets redstone control the spawner. Useful for switches, timers and farm control."]
	quest.78E93EEB139A2DCF.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Redstone Control Spawner Rune"
	quest.78E93EEB139A2DCF.title: "Redstone Control Spawner Rune"
	quest.78EE71687E06BB0D.quest_desc: ["Once you have mastered the basics, you can move on to working with Djinn, intermediate-level spirits."]
	quest.78EE71687E06BB0D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Book of Binding Djinni"
	quest.78FEBD362F77ED53.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Bronze Mixer. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.78FEBD362F77ED53.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Bronze Mixer"
	quest.7908B7140D3968AC.quest_desc: ["Pressurized Tubes are a way of transporting types of gas, such as steam, hydrogen, and oxygen. Transfer Rate: 2,000 mb/t."]
	quest.7908B7140D3968AC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Pressurized Tube"
	quest.791FBB3174C61904.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Assembler. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.791FBB3174C61904.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Assembler"
	quest.791FBB3174C61904.title: "Avengers, Assemble!"
	quest.792702F585B4AC44.quest_desc: ["Primogel Goo turns Iron Blocks into Raw Ferricore. Place the Iron Blocks on either side of the goo and feed it by right-clicking it with Rotten Flesh or Sugar. The item a goo block accepts is shown on any side of the block."]
	quest.792702F585B4AC44.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Iron Block, 2x Raw Ferricore and 2x Ferricore Ingot"
	quest.792702F585B4AC44.title: "Making Ferricore"
	quest.7928F7C6539606C1.quest_desc: ["Bring Tertium Gemstone into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7928F7C6539606C1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Tertium Gemstone"
	quest.7944DB1550E8A68B.quest_desc: ["Free Runners are an item that allows players to ascend 1-block inclines automatically (like the Horse), as well as preventing fall damage as long as they are charged. A fall will reduce the item's charge, depending on how far the fall was."]
	quest.7944DB1550E8A68B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Free Runners"
	quest.794841B00C233CDE.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Whitebeam Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.794841B00C233CDE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Whitebeam Sapling"
	quest.7949F86C9FF11AE1.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Jackfruit Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7949F86C9FF11AE1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Jackfruit Sapling"
	quest.794E82A9D10A4F25.quest_desc: ["Lets the wearer breathe underwater."]
	quest.794E82A9D10A4F25.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Snorkel"
	quest.79765BEC0A6FD693.quest_desc: ["Tier 2 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.79765BEC0A6FD693.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Pierce"
	quest.798931F2FBCE7245.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Implosion Compressor. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.798931F2FBCE7245.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Implosion Compressor"
	quest.798931F2FBCE7245.title: "Automated Creeper"
	quest.7994E33730AB8D3D.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Smart Filter. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7994E33730AB8D3D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.79AA4BDCE68B2106.quest_desc: ["Bring Energy Cell Starter into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.79AA4BDCE68B2106.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Cell Starter"
	quest.79C48188CA2E69E5.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Nuclear Reactor. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.79C48188CA2E69E5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Nuclear Reactor"
	quest.79C48188CA2E69E5.title: "3.6 Roentgen"
	quest.79DBC6A0539ADA92.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Charged Redstone. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.79DBC6A0539ADA92.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Charged Redstone"
	quest.79E0A15A0FBCD2CC.quest_desc: ["The Liquefaction Cauldron soaks resources in solvent to produce Sulfur from them. Heat is required for the reaction. Note that some resources, like ores, produce more than one sulfur."]
	quest.79E0A15A0FBCD2CC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Liquefaction Cauldron"
	quest.7A2423E7722019B9.quest_desc: ["The Chemical Injection Chamber uses Hydrogen Chloride gas to turn ores into 4 Shards. It is the start of x4 ore processing and requires a steady supply of Hydrogen Chloride, which in turn requires the player to have a Thermal Evaporation Plant running. It can also turn Water Vapor and Dirt into Clay. Like most Mekanism machines, the Chemical Injection Chamber has a Factory block of itself."]
	quest.7A2423E7722019B9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chemical Injection Chamber"
	quest.7A3E635BE3DB601B.quest_desc: ["Generates power from coal at 200 FE/t."]
	quest.7A3E635BE3DB601B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Furnator Hardened"
	quest.7A454EFA49F742A9.quest_desc: ["Bring Pigment Extractor into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7A454EFA49F742A9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pigment Extractor"
	quest.7A4B0862BC8E8B44.quest_desc: ["This module emits a redstone signal with strength proportional to the pressure within the tubes. When equipped with a Module Expansion Card, you can precisely adjust the threshold through the GUI."]
	quest.7A4B0862BC8E8B44.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pressure Gauge Module"
	quest.7A610F5F4F61052F.quest_desc: ["Bring Battery Nitro into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7A610F5F4F61052F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Battery Nitro"
	quest.7A65EC2241F7D9A4.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: Hill2."]
	quest.7A65EC2241F7D9A4.quest_subtitle: "Defeat a Redcap Sapper in a medium Hollow Hill"
	quest.7A815B50256D0495.quest_desc: ["Digs 4 surrounding holes to bedrock."]
	quest.7A815B50256D0495.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ritual Burrowing"
	quest.7A827B8762AEDD2A.quest_desc: ["Bring Dirt Seeds into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7A827B8762AEDD2A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Dirt Seeds"
	quest.7A93861BF8725930.quest_desc: ["For the Ultimate Laser Drill: It can be dyed! Press Left Shift + Right Button to swap between Fortune/Looting and Silk Touch. Use Alt + Mouse Scroll to change mining speed. Press Y while held or Right Button while hovered to toggle 3x3 mining."]
	quest.7A93861BF8725930.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ultimate Laser Drill"
	quest.7AA203EE4AC1BDC6.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Drone. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7AA203EE4AC1BDC6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Drone"
	quest.7ABBA78E7A372CF3.quest_desc: ["Thermodynamic Conductors are a way of transporting heat. Insulation: 100,000."]
	quest.7ABBA78E7A372CF3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ultimate Thermodynamic Conductor"
	quest.7ADC323CDD2E4AE9.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Pulsar Mantle. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7ADC323CDD2E4AE9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pulsar Mantle"
	quest.7AF77CA6AE4007D7.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.7AF77CA6AE4007D7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Purifying Factory"
	quest.7AF9291C0B6298A8.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Machinesettingscopier. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7AF9291C0B6298A8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Machinesettingscopier"
	quest.7AFDBDA8E91A6750.quest_desc: ["Increases attack speed."]
	quest.7AFDBDA8E91A6750.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Feral Claws"
	quest.7B18E086CE93DFC2.quest_desc: ["Light Gray Chalk serves as an improved foundational chalk above White, stabilizing pentacles made with it more."]
	quest.7B18E086CE93DFC2.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chalk Light Gray Impure"
	quest.7B1ED0C9D4271B85.quest_desc: ["Goggles allow you to see more information about placed Create components."]
	quest.7B1ED0C9D4271B85.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Goggles"
	quest.7B225E82C291C495.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Sour Cherry Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7B225E82C291C495.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Sour Cherry Sapling"
	quest.7B29A14775280AF9.quest_desc: ["Variants to find: the End Stronghold and the Nether Stronghold."]
	quest.7B29A14775280AF9.quest_subtitle: "Find both Stronghold variants"
	quest.7B2FDB2133E9252D.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Diamond Seeds. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7B2FDB2133E9252D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Diamond Seeds"
	quest.7B486B782E261467.quest_desc: ["QIO Drives hold the items in a QIO System. They work similar to AE2 drives where it has a maximum amount of space and types it can hold."]
	quest.7B486B782E261467.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Qio Drive Hyper Dense"
	quest.7B62B380000F160A.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Distillation Tower. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7B62B380000F160A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Distillation Tower"
	quest.7B62B380000F160A.title: "TOTAL Distillation"
	quest.7B75C398B88D5EC1.quest_desc: ["This is the Copper Drill. This will give you stones and dirts, mostly used as building materials. Check the outputs in EMI and make sure you know that the drill has a chance of breaking, so don't just make one."]
	quest.7B75C398B88D5EC1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Copper Drill"
	quest.7B75C398B88D5EC1.title: "Copper Drill"
	quest.7B793700836BA897.quest_desc: ["Bring White Poplar Sapling into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7B793700836BA897.quest_subtitle: "Obtain White Poplar Sapling"
	quest.7B8CBE1F84888E6F.quest_desc: ["Bring Transistor into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7B8CBE1F84888E6F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Transistor"
	quest.7B91CDC8202CB41F.quest_desc: ["Earn the advancement: Transform Poison."]
	quest.7B91CDC8202CB41F.quest_subtitle: "Earn the advancement: Transform Poison"
	quest.7B9913E754E714B7.quest_desc: ["Electric Pumps are a simple machine that, once put over a pool of liquid, gathers it at the cost of power. One example of early power generation is to put the pump in the Nether over lava and you virtually have an infinite lava source for heat generators."]
	quest.7B9913E754E714B7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Electric Pump"
	quest.7BAB96EC8F18DE53.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.7BAB96EC8F18DE53.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Summon Steed"
	quest.7BB09D3C9385785C.quest_desc: ["A unique axe dropped by the Minoshroom."]
	quest.7BB09D3C9385785C.quest_subtitle: "Get the Golden Minotaur Axe"
	quest.7BBBA6FAFE679818.quest_desc: ["Bring Diesel Jetpack into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7BBBA6FAFE679818.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Diesel Jetpack"
	quest.7BBBA6FAFE679818.title: "Ely... We Meant Jetpack!"
	quest.7BC7CD1E1D7D2A99.quest_desc: ["Bring Pink Salmon into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7BC7CD1E1D7D2A99.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pink Salmon"
	quest.7BDE1A49BE2173AC.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Furnator Spirited. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7BDE1A49BE2173AC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Furnator Spirited"
	quest.7BE91B78520F564B.quest_desc: ["This is an advanced version of the Liquid Compressor. It offers a much faster generation rate of 50 mL/tick but also produces heat. As the temperature rises, efficiency decreases. The bottom arrow on the temperature gauge shows where efficiency will begin to decline, while the top arrow indicates the point of 0% efficiency. Contrary to expectations, this machine will not explode even if the temperature becomes excessively high."]
	quest.7BE91B78520F564B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Liquid Compressor"
	quest.7BED617A7B733C23.quest_desc: ["Blocks of voidflame coal can be transformed into raw eclipse ember. 3–4 eclipse embers will drop from it. Burns 81x more items than coal."]
	quest.7BED617A7B733C23.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Coal T4"
	quest.7BF5087C34F404B5.quest_desc: ["Captured blazes enjoy eggs, like their distant forbear, Calcifer."]
	quest.7BF5087C34F404B5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blaze Burner"
	quest.7BFD40F887AEABA1.quest_desc: ["Increases luck."]
	quest.7BFD40F887AEABA1.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Gold Hook"
	quest.7C0184A29B8530EB.quest_desc: ["Used to create ME Storage Cells."]
	quest.7C0184A29B8530EB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cell Component 1k"
	quest.7C07BB3BBB3FDF77.quest_desc: ["A Steel Ingot can be created by smelting Steel Dust in any type of furnace."]
	quest.7C07BB3BBB3FDF77.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ingot Steel"
	quest.7C07BB3BBB3FDF77.title: "Steel Ingot"
	quest.7C09410A1FD486BD.quest_desc: ["With the help of spirits, it's possible to create a link to another dimension where you can store all of those items you've amassed - truly, your collection is a marvel. You'll need the Storage Actuator to do this. Think of it as a really big chest."]
	quest.7C09410A1FD486BD.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Storage Controller"
	quest.7C0A1B83C10124DA.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Citron Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7C0A1B83C10124DA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Citron Sapling"
	quest.7C23C05B8F70779F.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Fluid Valve. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7C23C05B8F70779F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fluid Valve"
	quest.7C27AA86443ED0F9.quest_desc: ["Sneak and right-click with the rod to open its screen and equip hooks, bobbers and baits."]
	quest.7C27AA86443ED0F9.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Starcatcher Rod"
	quest.7C341563D8014FB6.quest_desc: ["Chemical Tanks are Mekanism's batteries for storing Gases. They can be placed as a block and do interact with Pressurized Tubes. They come in the four levels, each increasing the storage capacity and output rate."]
	quest.7C341563D8014FB6.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Chemical Tank"
	quest.7C3C26679DDAC466.quest_desc: ["This is the base ring to create other magical rings."]
	quest.7C3C26679DDAC466.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ring of Potential"
	quest.7C4787163949EC8E.quest_desc: ["With Brass Funnels, you can even filter a Mechanical Arm's targets."]
	quest.7C4787163949EC8E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mechanical Arm"
	quest.7C484AA252A54063.quest_desc: ["Glowstone Ingots are made by putting Glowstone in a powered Osmium Compressor with Glowstone in the top and Osmium Ingots in the bottom. Glowstone Ingots can be used for making Glowstone Armor, Refined Glowstone blocks and Teleporter Frames."]
	quest.7C484AA252A54063.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ingot Refined Glowstone"
	quest.7C5B17F127E7784B.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Cocobolo Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7C5B17F127E7784B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cocobolo Sapling"
	quest.7C6FF2A1C1753EBB.quest_desc: ["Universal Cables are Mekanism's way to transfer power. Capacity: 409.60 kFE/t."]
	quest.7C6FF2A1C1753EBB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Elite Universal Cable"
	quest.7C6FF2A1C1753EBB.title: "Elite Universal Cable"
	quest.7C77202B82BD425C.quest_desc: ["Reprocssed Fissile Fragments can be processed in an Injection Chamber with Hdyrogen Chloride to make Fissile Fuel."]
	quest.7C77202B82BD425C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Reprocessed Fissile Fragment"
	quest.7C7C882001DA2B9F.quest_desc: ["Attracts nearby items."]
	quest.7C7C882001DA2B9F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Universal Attractor"
	quest.7C80C8D1FCBB98AB.quest_desc: ["Emeralds can be found while mining, exploring, or trading with villagers and is used to craft the Evocation Scrolls."]
	quest.7C80C8D1FCBB98AB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Emerald"
	quest.7C850BA1B451D57C.quest_desc: ["Simple version: places fluids, with speed and orientation controls and optional redstone sensitivity. Advanced version: adds filtering and offset AOE, and needs power."]
	quest.7C850BA1B451D57C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.7C9A1D06EC6F7BD4.quest_desc: ["Lets the wearer see in the dark."]
	quest.7C9A1D06EC6F7BD4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Night Vision Goggles"
	quest.7CAB3134D2EE78C5.quest_desc: ["Used to summon several forms of wilden including the Wilden Chimera."]
	quest.7CAB3134D2EE78C5.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ritual Wilden Summon"
	quest.7CB53630F548B2E8.quest_desc: ["Bring Fish Seeds into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7CB53630F548B2E8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Fish Seeds"
	quest.7CD904A99A98F388.quest_desc: ["Bring Magmator Starter into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7CD904A99A98F388.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Magmator Starter"
	quest.7CDC197CBB934198.quest_desc: ["Bring Hunting Belt into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7CDC197CBB934198.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Hunting Belt"
	quest.7D027650D0554AE8.quest_desc: ["Swaps the item in your hand for the one that works best on the block or entity you left-click."]
	quest.7D027650D0554AE8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Tool Swapper Upgrade"
	quest.7D074CDAA4B03FAE.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Supremium Watering Can. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7D074CDAA4B03FAE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Supremium Watering Can"
	quest.7D0C5977BAFE0157.quest_desc: ["Certus Quartz is found as ore underground and inside meteorites. Its crystals are the base of most AE2 materials."]
	quest.7D313F28BBB47A6F.quest_desc: ["Like the Magnet Upgrade, with more filtering options."]
	quest.7D313F28BBB47A6F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Advanced Magnet Upgrade"
	quest.7D3F97C5832AF3B7.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Blank Thread. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7D3F97C5832AF3B7.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Blank Thread"
	quest.7D5135449D0544A8.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.7D5135449D0544A8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Basic Infusing Factory"
	quest.7D5AB924D152BDB8.quest_desc: ["Bring Enchanted Gravitite into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7D5AB924D152BDB8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Enchanted Gravitite"
	quest.7D5AB924D152BDB8.title: "Pink is the New Blue"
	quest.7D5BE375773C489E.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Mechanical Bearing. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7D5BE375773C489E.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mechanical Bearing"
	quest.7D659D5269823682.quest_desc: ["Breaks blocks without solid colision boxes.. like tracks, levers, buttons, etc."]
	quest.7D659D5269823682.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Mechanical Plough"
	quest.7D6F8AF3728BEA44.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Source Gem Block. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7D6F8AF3728BEA44.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Source Gem Block"
	quest.7D72B278D68E7B8C.quest_desc: ["Lets the wearer walk on powder snow and makes ice less slippery."]
	quest.7D72B278D68E7B8C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Snowshoes"
	quest.7D73F7A74981606A.quest_desc: ["Bring Smart Filter into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7D73F7A74981606A.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Smart Filter"
	quest.7D73F7A74981606A.title: "Alchemical Niter"
	quest.7D80ADA71E6B6C65.quest_desc: ["A collection point for feeding bees that holds 3 item blocks. When Lumber or Quarry bees feed from it, it produces a random item. It can be honeylogged, which gives the bees regeneration."]
	quest.7D80ADA71E6B6C65.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Feeder"
	quest.7D92ED988DF486ED.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Cedar Sapling. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7D92ED988DF486ED.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cedar Sapling"
	quest.7D9C263C62F23F27.quest_desc: ["This Rod is pre-attuned to find Budding Amethyst. Amethyst is used rather a lot in alchemy, and is needed for better Divining Rods."]
	quest.7D9C263C62F23F27.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Amethyst Divination Rod"
	quest.7D9CEC4EB58A7E23.quest_desc: ["Bring Assembly Program Drill Laser into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7D9CEC4EB58A7E23.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Assembly Program Drill Laser"
	quest.7DB2F0894066E0B3.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Emblem of Defense. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7DB2F0894066E0B3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Emblem of Defense"
	quest.7DB66A8913111410.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Walnut Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7DB66A8913111410.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Walnut Sapling"
	quest.7DBF313D54FA739C.quest_desc: ["The first tier of spawner upgrades. It improves the basic spawning stats of a spawner beyond vanilla limits."]
	quest.7DBF313D54FA739C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Frontier Spawner Upgrade Rune"
	quest.7DBF313D54FA739C.title: "Frontier Spawner Upgrade Rune"
	quest.7DC30C7C1E0B6563.quest_desc: ["Used to craft upgrades for storage."]
	quest.7DC30C7C1E0B6563.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Upgrade Base"
	quest.7DCD8D983E05F9E4.quest_desc: ["Spider Overhaul adds new spider variants and behaviors. Watch where you travel, especially in dark or enclosed areas, and learn how the variants differ."]
	quest.7DCD8D983E05F9E4.title: "Getting Started"
	quest.7DD6256662D787D8.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Nether Quartz Seeds. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7DD6256662D787D8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Nether Quartz Seeds"
	quest.7DEB14F944374E25.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Awakened Supremium Essence. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7DEB14F944374E25.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Awakened Supremium Essence"
	quest.7E12929804B4E696.quest_desc: ["Orange Chalk is perfect for calling upon Afrit, though it does not offer control over them."]
	quest.7E12929804B4E696.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chalk Orange Impure"
	quest.7E16C414F4B39363.quest_desc: ["Used for 1 time teleportation."]
	quest.7E16C414F4B39363.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Warp Scroll"
	quest.7E1CC8A6310C2424.quest_desc: ["Bring Disk Drive 4k into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7E1CC8A6310C2424.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Disk Drive 4k"
	quest.7E2522100BFBA8CB.quest_desc: ["WannaBees can extract mob loot from mobs encased in amber."]
	quest.7E2522100BFBA8CB.quest_subtitle: "Get a WannaBee spawn egg"
	quest.7E2522100BFBA8CB.title: "WannaBee"
	quest.7E2A26EC8946F384.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Cave Dweller Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7E2A26EC8946F384.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Cave Dweller Sapling"
	quest.7E4D92A6BD9831D4.quest_desc: ["Sourceberry bushes grow in taiga and archwood biomes. The berries are used for Source Berry Rolls and Pies and for mana regeneration potions."]
	quest.7E4D92A6BD9831D4.quest_subtitle: "Obtain 2x Sourceberry Bush"
	quest.7E4D92A6BD9831D4.title: "Sourceberries"
	quest.7E4EC4681E63F0F9.quest_desc: ["Ah, the humble but reliable Millstone. The Crushing Wheels may be faster, but the millstone fits better in many builds.. and you don't fit in it, so there's that."]
	quest.7E4EC4681E63F0F9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Millstone"
	quest.7E5248111AE003B3.quest_desc: ["The Oven gives your kitchen smelting abilities."]
	quest.7E5248111AE003B3.quest_subtitle: "Adds smelting to your kitchen"
	quest.7E578D628F1DEBCB.quest_desc: ["Chemical Tanks are Mekanism's batteries for storing Gases. They can be placed as a block and do interact with Pressurized Tubes. They come in the four levels, each increasing the storage capacity and output rate."]
	quest.7E578D628F1DEBCB.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Elite Chemical Tank"
	quest.7E66A8EEB887105F.quest_desc: ["Can run recipes of any single block electric crafting machine provided to it in batches. Batch size is determined by the amount of machines provided to it. Insert electric crafting machines to run in parallel."]
	quest.7E66A8EEB887105F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Processing Array, 16x Clean Stainless Steel Machine Casing, 2x Stainless Steel Machine Casing Pipe and 2x Glass"
	quest.7E74EE5E4399496A.quest_desc: ["Any animal in the Twilight Forest counts."]
	quest.7E74EE5E4399496A.quest_subtitle: "Hunt some local wildlife"
	quest.7E7DBC9818076878.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Ring of Elusiveness. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7E7DBC9818076878.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ring of Elusiveness"
	quest.7E95240CA9FDB47B.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Player Transmitter Blazing. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7E95240CA9FDB47B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Player Transmitter Blazing"
	quest.7E995ED1725E1A80.quest_desc: ["Smelts 24 items."]
	quest.7E995ED1725E1A80.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Prudentium Coal"
	quest.7EC392D4AD679DB5.quest_desc: ["Find a city in the Overworld."]
	quest.7EC392D4AD679DB5.quest_subtitle: "Enter an Overworld City"
	quest.7ED1EA0C9E87DD59.quest_desc: ["Allows you to make patterns that need to be inserted specific direction to tell it through the pattern what side of the machine its importing/exporting."]
	quest.7ED1EA0C9E87DD59.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Adv Pattern Encoder"
	quest.7EECE4B9127EB096.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Juniper Sapling. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7EECE4B9127EB096.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Juniper Sapling"
	quest.7EF6D60AF9198383.quest_desc: ["Bring Quantum Bubble into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7EF6D60AF9198383.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Quantum Bubble"
	quest.7EF729C49781FC32.quest_desc: ["Expands the inventory of the shulker box."]
	quest.7EF729C49781FC32.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Netherite Shulker Box"
	quest.7EF7A2E8EEEA8535.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Knightmetal Seeds. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7EF7A2E8EEEA8535.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Knightmetal Seeds"
	quest.7EFD9AEF5DA3A64B.quest_desc: ["Enchanter's tools can be given a spell at the Scribe's Table. The Mirror casts a self spell on you at a discount with extra duration on its glyphs, and it does not need a Form glyph like the other tools."]
	quest.7EFD9AEF5DA3A64B.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Wand, Enchanters Sword, Enchanters Shield and 2 more items"
	quest.7EFD9AEF5DA3A64B.title: "Enchanter's Tools"
	quest.7F0187ACE5E5B240.quest_desc: ["Tier 2 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.7F0187ACE5E5B240.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Explosion"
	quest.7F0C39C1BE98DA73.quest_desc: ["This device converts compressed air into Forge Energy (compatible with RF and many other mods’ energy). It has a base efficiency of 40%, meaning 100 mL of air generates 40 FE. Speed Upgrades will slightly reduce this efficiency. The Dynamo also produces heat, which needs to be managed to prevent a loss in efficiency."]
	quest.7F0C39C1BE98DA73.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Pneumatic Dynamo"
	quest.7F167264C32900F9.quest_desc: ["Bring Purple Spiral Sapling into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7F167264C32900F9.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Purple Spiral Sapling"
	quest.7F17DEB90BDCB5D3.quest_desc: ["Tier 1 glyph. Craft it at the Scribe\'s Table."]
	quest.7F17DEB90BDCB5D3.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Glyph Self"
	quest.7F2E9B7E0F5AAFC8.quest_desc: ["The Rotary Condensentrator (pronounced \"con-DEN-sen-traitor\") is used for converting substances between liquid and gaseous forms at a rate of 1:1. It has two modes: Decondensentrating, which turns Liquids into Gases, and Condensentrating, which turns Gases into Liquids."]
	quest.7F2E9B7E0F5AAFC8.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Rotary Condensentrator"
	quest.7F4F05267ACB5A78.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Supremium Ingot. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7F4F05267ACB5A78.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Supremium Ingot"
	quest.7F6887517E63F6BE.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Configurable Honeycomb. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7F6887517E63F6BE.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.7F6BEA087FCC880D.quest_desc: ["The Chemical Dissolution Chamber is the first machine in the x5 ore processing setup."]
	quest.7F6BEA087FCC880D.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Chemical Dissolution Chamber"
	quest.7F80CAF056A68482.quest_desc: ["Powered Crystal Growth Accelerators speed up the growth of adjacent budding quartz. Must be powered via the top or bottom, and consumes a steady 8 ae/t while plugged in."]
	quest.7F80CAF056A68482.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Growth Accelerator"
	quest.7F8EC51B1C57FBAA.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.7F8EC51B1C57FBAA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ultimate Purifying Factory"
	quest.7FA15C398E515DBC.quest_desc: ["Bring Springy Boot into your inventory. Check EMI with R on the item if you are unsure how to get it."]
	quest.7FA15C398E515DBC.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Springy Boot"
	quest.7FAC2F1EF914698C.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Configurable Honeycomb. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7FAC2F1EF914698C.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Configurable Honeycomb"
	quest.7FCE81F4EB5DB0C6.quest_desc: ["Defeat Priest."]
	quest.7FCE81F4EB5DB0C6.quest_subtitle: "Defeat Priest"
	quest.7FD2757B52219527.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Portal Frame. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7FD2757B52219527.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Portal Frame"
	quest.7FE51DF3CB943492.quest_desc: ["Get hold of Energy Cable Nitro. Hover over it in EMI and press R to see how it is made."]
	quest.7FE51DF3CB943492.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Energy Cable Nitro"
	quest.7FE84DDB0ADF827F.quest_desc: ["This quest asks for Assembly Platform, Assembly Laser, Assembly Io Unit Import and 3 more items. EMI shows the recipe if you press R while hovering over it."]
	quest.7FE84DDB0ADF827F.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Assembly Platform, Assembly Laser, Assembly Io Unit Import and 3 more items"
	quest.7FF560F3DCCC23BE.quest_desc: ["The Engineering Press is used in an Inscriber to turn Diamond into a Printed Engineering Circuit. Presses are found in meteorites, and the Inscriber can duplicate one with an Iron Block."]
	quest.7FFB1CDFDA24C2EA.quest_desc: ["Factories are advanced forms of the basic machines aimed to assist in large scale resource processing."]
	quest.7FFB1CDFDA24C2EA.quest_subtitle: "Obtain Ultimate Smelting Factory"
	quest.811B5DBA9C3B6C69.quest_desc: ["Quantum Ring blocks create the frame around a Quantum Link Chamber. Their recipe requires Logic and Engineering Processors, an Energy Cell, iron, and Smart Dense Cable."]
	quest.811B5DBA9C3B6C69.title: "Craft Quantum Ring Blocks"
	quest.8DE444535D7AD8C7.quest_desc: ["NeoTech Reborn is designed to look great while running smoothly. Complementary Unbound and BSL shaders are included, alongside pre-applied resource packs and datapacks for a cohesive experience. 14 GB or more of RAM is recommended; 10–12 GB is the minimum."]
	quest.8DE444535D7AD8C7.quest_subtitle: "Visual polish, shaders, and practical performance guidance."
	quest.8DE444535D7AD8C7.title: "Visuals and Performance"
	quest.8FFFDAD81B77E91B.quest_desc: ["The Wireless Terminal gives wireless access to your ME network when linked to a powered Wireless Access Point. It requires a Receiver, Terminal, and Dense Energy Cell."]
	quest.8FFFDAD81B77E91B.title: "Access Items from Anywhere Nearby"
	quest.9153ACA88F3D86A4.quest_desc: ["Formation Cores are used by export and crafting components. Their recipe combines Certus Quartz, Fluix Dust, and a Logic Processor."]
	quest.9153ACA88F3D86A4.title: "Craft Formation Cores"
	quest.916DD681DFE4FCE2.quest_desc: ["Quartz Fiber separates power between connected ME networks while still allowing data to pass. It is also used in wireless components."]
	quest.916DD681DFE4FCE2.title: "Make Quartz Fiber"
	quest.94885582FF7946C6.quest_desc: ["A Fluix Pearl is made from Fluix, Fluix Dust, and an Ender Pearl. It is required for AE2 wireless components and the Quantum Link Chamber."]
	quest.94885582FF7946C6.title: "Create a Fluix Pearl"
	quest.9EAF8522B35926AD.quest_desc: ["Combine the Item Cell Housing and 1k Cell Component to make a 1k Item Storage Cell. Insert it into an ME Drive to store items on the network."]
	quest.9EAF8522B35926AD.title: "Assemble a 1k Item Storage Cell"
	quest.A13CE3F55A19E03C.quest_desc: ["The Matter Condenser consumes items from an ME network and turns accumulated matter into Singularities. Connect it to a powered network and give it items to process."]
	quest.A13CE3F55A19E03C.title: "Build a Matter Condenser"
	quest.B6DA5F849F19EF81.quest_desc: ["Crafting Units form the foundation of an ME Crafting CPU. Add crafting storage and other CPU components to expand the size and speed of crafting jobs."]
	quest.B6DA5F849F19EF81.title: "Build a Crafting Unit"
	quest.C24830A27A12C286.quest_desc: ["A Pattern Provider supplies encoded patterns to adjacent inventories or machines. It is a key part of connecting external processing to ME autocrafting."]
	quest.C24830A27A12C286.title: "Provide Patterns to Machines"
	quest.CA090624224EA826.quest_desc: ["An Export Bus pushes selected items from your network into an attached inventory. Use it to supply machines or keep blocks stocked."]
	quest.CA090624224EA826.title: "Automate Item Output"
	quest.D45DB55E7E3CA223.quest_desc: ["Annihilation Cores are used by import and crafting components. Their recipe combines Nether Quartz, Fluix Dust, and a Logic Processor."]
	quest.D45DB55E7E3CA223.title: "Craft Annihilation Cores"
	quest.DC9215C9F5C006B1.quest_desc: ["The Item Cell Housing combines with a storage component to make an item cell. Keep item storage cells distinct from fluid and spatial cells."]
	quest.DC9215C9F5C006B1.title: "Prepare an Item Cell Housing"
	quest.EAE1FEA40BF08A63.quest_desc: ["The Pattern Encoding Terminal lets you encode patterns for crafting and processing. It is made by upgrading a Crafting Terminal with an Engineering Processor."]
	quest.EAE1FEA40BF08A63.title: "Encode Processing Patterns"
	quest.EBD12705DAA31418.quest_desc: ["The ME Drive holds storage cells and connects them to your ME network. Add storage cells to the drive, then connect it with Fluix Glass Cable."]
	quest.EBD12705DAA31418.title: "Build an ME Drive"
	quest.ED18447EBCE105C3.quest_desc: ["A Dense Energy Cell stores more power than the standard cell. It is also a component for the Wireless Terminal."]
	quest.ED18447EBCE105C3.title: "Upgrade to a Dense Energy Cell"
	quest.EEB89581C16837DA.quest_desc: ["There is no single way to play. Follow a tech or magic system, explore dungeons and dimensions, build, farm, collect gear, or simply discover what the pack has to offer."]
	quest.EEB89581C16837DA.quest_subtitle: "Pick a direction, or follow several."
	quest.EEB89581C16837DA.title: "Choose Your Adventure"
	quest.F330DEDCCD874A5D.quest_desc: ["An autocrafting setup combines an ME Crafting CPU, Molecular Assemblers, Pattern Providers, and encoded patterns. Connect the components to your network and configure a recipe in the Pattern Encoding Terminal."]
	quest.F330DEDCCD874A5D.title: "Set Up ME Autocrafting"
	quest.F94DE7233A4DA87E.quest_desc: ["The Wireless Access Point connects wireless terminals to a nearby ME network. Attach it to the network and provide power before using a terminal."]
	quest.F94DE7233A4DA87E.title: "Extend the Network Wirelessly"
	quest.FA862D49ECF37798.quest_desc: ["The Molecular Assembler crafts recipes automatically when supplied with ingredients by an ME network. It uses both core types and a crafting table."]
	quest.FA862D49ECF37798.title: "Craft with a Molecular Assembler"
	quest.FBEAA2C4C096AA5E.quest_desc: ["The ME Controller is the central block of a channel-based ME network. Its recipe uses Fluix and an Engineering Processor; connect it to your powered cable network."]
	quest.FBEAA2C4C096AA5E.title: "Build an ME Controller"
